Route102_Text_CalvinIntro:
	.string "你身上带着宝可梦的话，\n"
	.string "就算是正式的宝可梦训练家！\l"
	.string "可不能拒绝我的挑战哦！$"

Route102_Text_CalvinDefeated:
	.string "唔，我输了……\n"
	.string "我应该多锻炼一下的……$"

Route102_Text_CalvinPostBattle:
	.string "喂，你要是很强的话，\n"
	.string "就该早点告诉我啊！$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRegister:
	.string "自从上次见过你之后，\n"
	.string "我一直在努力训练。\p"
	.string "我还想再和你对战，\n"
	.string "能把我登记进导航里吗？$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRegisterShort:
	.string "我还想再和你对战，\n"
	.string "能让我登记一下吗？$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRematchIntro:
	.string "自从输给你之后，\n"
	.string "我拼命地锻炼了宝可梦。\l"
	.string "可不能拒绝我的挑战哦！$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRematchDefeated:
	.string "唔，我输了……\n"
	.string "是我的训练方法不对吗？$"

Route102_Text_CalvinRematchPostBattle:
	.string "你要变强的话，\n"
	.string "我也会变得更强。$"

Route102_Text_AllenIntro:
	.string "你也是刚成为训练家的吧？\n"
	.string "我们都是新手！$"

Route102_Text_AllenDefeated:
	.string "我还以为能赢你，\n"
	.string "才叫住你的……$"

Route102_Text_AllenPostBattle:
	.string "我一次都还没赢过……\n"
	.string "好想快点赢一次啊……$"

Route102_Text_RickIntro:
	.string "哈哈！我们目光相遇了！\n"
	.string "我用虫宝可梦来对付你！$"

Route102_Text_RickDefeated:
	.string "哎哟！输得一败涂地！$"

Route102_Text_RickPostBattle:
	.string "和训练家对上目光，\n"
	.string "就必须挑战！这是规矩！$"

Route102_Text_TianaIntro:
	.string "我要一直赢下去，\n"
	.string "成为最棒的训练家。\p"
	.string "请帮我积累经验吧！$"

Route102_Text_TianaDefeated:
	.string "结果倒是帮你积累了经验……$"

Route102_Text_TianaPostBattle:
	.string "要想一直赢下去，\n"
	.string "看来我得多抓些宝可梦才行。$"

Route103_Text_DaisyIntro:
	.string "你感受到我们治愈心灵的\n"
	.string "芳香了吗？$"

Route103_Text_DaisyDefeated:
	.string "你没被我们的香气迷惑……$"

Route103_Text_DaisyPostBattle:
	.string "芳香疗法是利用香气\n"
	.string "进行心灵治疗的方法。$"

Route103_Text_AmyIntro:
	.string "AMY：我是AMY。\n"
	.string "这是我的妹妹LIV。\l"
	.string "我们一起对战！$"

Route103_Text_AmyDefeated:
	.string "AMY：哎呀，我们输了。$"

Route103_Text_AmyPostBattle:
	.string "AMY：和两个训练家同时对战，\n"
	.string "要考虑各种各样的事情呢。$"

Route103_Text_AmyNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "AMY：哎呀，你只带了一只\n"
	.string "宝可梦。\l"
	.string "这样可没法和我们打哦。$"

Route103_Text_LivIntro:
	.string "LIV：我们是两人一体的\n"
	.string "队伍。$"

Route103_Text_LivDefeated:
	.string "LIV：啊，姐姐，我们输了……$"

Route103_Text_LivPostBattle:
	.string "LIV：我和姐姐配合得很好……\p"
	.string "可我们还是输了……$"

Route103_Text_AmyLivRegister:
	.string "LIV：真的，我们其实更强……\n"
	.string "下次一定让你见识！$"

Route103_Text_LivNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "LIV：想和我们打的话，\n"
	.string "得带两只宝可梦才行！\l"
	.string "不然太不公平了！$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchIntro:
	.string "AMY：我是AMY。\n"
	.string "这是我的妹妹LIV。\l"
	.string "我们一起对战！$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchDefeated:
	.string "AMY：哎呀呀！\n"
	.string "我们又没能赢……$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchPostBattle:
	.string "AMY：和两个训练家同时对战，\n"
	.string "要考虑各种各样的事情呢。$"

Route103_Text_AmyRematchNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "AMY：哎呀，你只带了一只\n"
	.string "宝可梦。\l"
	.string "这样可没法和我们打哦。$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchIntro:
	.string "LIV：我们是两人一体的\n"
	.string "队伍。$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchDefeated:
	.string "LIV：啊，我们又输了……\n"
	.string "姐姐……$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchPostBattle:
	.string "LIV：我和姐姐配合得很好……\p"
	.string "可为什么又输了？$"

Route103_Text_LivRematchNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "LIV：想和我们打的话，\n"
	.string "得带两只宝可梦才行！\l"
	.string "不然太不公平了！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelIntro:
	.string "我的宝可梦可爱得不得了！\n"
	.string "别害羞——让你看看！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelDefeated:
	.string "哎呀！\n"
	.string "我亲爱的宝可梦！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelPostBattle:
	.string "我的宝可梦就算倒下了，\n"
	.string "也依然可爱！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRegister:
	.string "下次再来看我可爱的\n"
	.string "宝可梦吧！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRematchIntro:
	.string "嘿，你！我可爱的宝可梦\n"
	.string "变得更可爱了！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRematchDefeated:
	.string "哦！\n"
	.string "我亲爱的宝可梦！$"

Route103_Text_MiguelRematchPostBattle:
	.string "和它相处得越久，\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦就越可爱。$"

Route103_Text_PeteIntro:
	.string "这么点距离……\n"
	.string "游过去就好了！$"

Route103_Text_PeteDefeated:
	.string "哦，干得不错！$"

Route103_Text_PetePostBattle:
	.string "哦，我现在明白你的意思了。\p"
	.string "要有那么可靠的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我也想骑着它冲浪！$"

Route103_Text_IsabelleIntro:
	.string "看路啊！\n"
	.string "要撞上了！$"

Route103_Text_IsabelleDefeated:
	.string "唔……$"

Route103_Text_IsabellePostBattle:
	.string "我游泳不太好，正在练习……\n"
	.string "抱歉差点撞到你。$"

Route103_Text_RhettIntro:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "你怎么挤进这么窄的地方的？$"

Route103_Text_RhettDefeated:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "这小子真行！$"

Route103_Text_RhettPostBattle:
	.string "你喜欢这种狭窄的\n"
	.string "地方吗？$"

Route103_Text_MarcosIntro:
	.string "是我的吉他声把你引来的吗？$"

Route103_Text_MarcosDefeated:
	.string "我的个人演出泡汤了……$"

Route103_Text_MarcosPostBattle:
	.string "我在人少的地方弹吉他，\n"
	.string "结果聚来了很多粉丝。\p"
	.string "呵，也许我该出道了。$"

Route104_Text_GinaIntro:
	.string "吉娜：好，用宝可梦来\n"
	.string "对战吧！$"

Route104_Text_GinaDefeat:
	.string "吉娜：输了我很不甘心！$"

Route104_Text_GinaPostBattle:
	.string "吉娜：你很强！\n"
	.string "我们得多多训练！$"

Route104_Text_GinaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "吉娜：哦？只有一只宝可梦？\n"
	.string "那我们不和你打。\p"
	.string "只有一只会很孤单，\n"
	.string "那可不好。$"

Route104_Text_MiaIntro:
	.string "米亚：我们是双胞胎，\n"
	.string "所以一起对战。$"

Route104_Text_MiaDefeat:
	.string "米亚：我们一起战斗，\n"
	.string "却一起输了……$"

Route104_Text_MiaPostBattle:
	.string "米亚：我们会多训练宝可梦，\n"
	.string "变得像你一样强。$"

Route104_Text_MiaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "米亚：想和我们打？\p"
	.string "没带两只宝可梦可不行哦。\l"
	.string "我们对你来说太强了！$"

Route104_Text_IvanIntro:
	.string "为什么要保密？\n"
	.string "我可是水属性宝可梦专家！\p"
	.string "嗯？\n"
	.string "你不认识我？$"

Route104_Text_IvanDefeat:
	.string "我还以为自己挺不错的，\n"
	.string "看来不是……唉……$"

Route104_Text_IvanPostBattle:
	.string "我太沉迷钓鱼了。\n"
	.string "忘了要培养宝可梦……$"

Route104_Text_BillyIntro:
	.string "在沙子上留下脚印\n"
	.string "真好玩！$"

Route104_Text_BillyDefeat:
	.string "哇！沙子进鞋里了！\n"
	.string "硌得慌！$"

Route104_Text_BillyPostBattle:
	.string "我想在沙子上留脚印，\n"
	.string "可它很快就消失了……$"

Route104_Text_HaleyIntro:
	.string "我该……\n"
	.string "还是不该？\p"
	.string "好吧，就打一场！$"

Route104_Text_HaleyDefeat:
	.string "早知道就不打了……$"

Route104_Text_HaleyPostBattle:
	.string "面对选择时让人替你做决定，\n"
	.string "不管结果如何都会后悔。$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRegister1:
	.string "你很强，要把你登记进\n"
	.string "导航里吗？\l"
	.string "也许不该……\p"
	.string "好吧，就登记你！$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRegister2:
	.string "你很强，要把你登记进\n"
	.string "导航里吗？\l"
	.string "也许不该……\p"
	.string "好吧，就登记你！$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRematchIntro:
	.string "来吧，和我对战！$"

Route104_Text_HaleyRematchDefeat:
	.string "唉……\n"
	.string "我以为能赢的……$"

Route104_Text_HaleyPostRematch:
	.string "我决定要打，所以\n"
	.string "输也输得心服口服。\p"
	.string "可我还是很不甘心！$"

Route104_Text_WinstonIntro:
	.string "哦，好，我接受你的挑战。\n"
	.string "我钱多得是。$"

Route104_Text_WinstonDefeat:
	.string "为什么赢不了呢？$"

Route104_Text_WinstonPostBattle:
	.string "有些东西是钱买不到的。\n"
	.string "那就是宝可梦……$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRegister1:
	.string "嗯？\n"
	.string "啊，你拿到导航了。\p"
	.string "我很乐意登记。\n"
	.string "毕竟我钱多得是。$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRegister2:
	.string "嗯？\n"
	.string "啊，你拿到导航了。\p"
	.string "我很乐意登记。\n"
	.string "毕竟我钱多得是。$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRematchIntro:
	.string "输给你之后，我学到了\n"
	.string "很多关于宝可梦的事。$"

Route104_Text_WinstonRematchDefeat:
	.string "又输了？\n"
	.string "为什么赢不了呢？$"

Route104_Text_WinstonPostRematch:
	.string "我富得流油，却怎么也\n"
	.string "赢不了宝可梦对战……\p"
	.string "宝可梦的世界真深奥……$"

Route104_Text_CindyIntro:
	.string "我们相遇一定是命运。\n"
	.string "能和我对战吗？$"

Route104_Text_CindyDefeat:
	.string "哎呀！$"

Route104_Text_CindyPostBattle:
	.string "“你好”是“再见”的开始。\n"
	.string "希望还能再见。$"

Route104_Text_CindyRegister1:
	.string "你好，我们又见面了。\p"
	.string "我们好像互相吸引。\n"
	.string "把彼此登记进导航吧。$"

Route104_Text_CindyRegister2:
	.string "我们该纪念一下这份缘分。\p"
	.string "把彼此登记进导航吧。$"

Route104_Text_CindyRematchIntro:
	.string "你好，我们又见面了。\n"
	.string "能和我对战吗？$"

Route104_Text_CindyRematchDefeat:
	.string "哎呀……\n"
	.string "我已经尽力了……$"

Route104_Text_CindyPostRematch:
	.string "“你好”是“再见”的开始。\n"
	.string "希望还能再见。$"

Route104_Text_DarianIntro:
	.string "我钓上来一只很凶的宝可梦！\p"
	.string "它有种神奇的气质！\n"
	.string "确实很凶，没错！$"

Route104_Text_DarianDefeat:
	.string "什么……$"

Route104_Text_DarianPostBattle:
	.string "喂，鲤鱼王，你可真不配\n"
	.string "你那个名字啊？$"

Route105_Text_FosterIntro:
	.string "这附近应该有一块神秘的\n"
	.string "石头。\l"
	.string "你知道些什么吗？$"

Route105_Text_FosterDefeated:
	.string "我一直在想那块石头，\n"
	.string "宝可梦却还是那么弱……$"

Route105_Text_FosterPostBattle:
	.string "我可以盯着漂亮的石头\n"
	.string "看上好几个小时也不腻。$"

Route105_Text_LuisIntro:
	.string "呼！看到你时我还担心\n"
	.string "有孩子溺水了。\p"
	.string "看起来你没事，\n"
	.string "那要不要来一场对战？$"

Route105_Text_LuisDefeated:
	.string "咕噜……咕噜……$"

Route105_Text_LuisPostBattle:
	.string "如果溺水了，求救信号是\n"
	.string "朝岸边挥舞一只手臂。$"

Route105_Text_DominikIntro:
	.string "在深蓝的大海里游泳……\n"
	.string "感觉最棒了！$"

Route105_Text_DominikDefeated:
	.string "我输了……\n"
	.string "现在心情低落了……$"

Route105_Text_DominikPostBattle:
	.string "海为什么是蓝色的？\p"
	.string "我在凯那市的博物馆学过，\n"
	.string "但忘了。$"

Route105_Text_BeverlyIntro:
	.string "在水里身体会变轻。\n"
	.string "好像变瘦了一样！$"

Route105_Text_BeverlyDefeated:
	.string "我飘起来了……$"

Route105_Text_PostBattle:
	.string "在水里体重只有\n"
	.string "十分之一。\p"
	.string "那我就……\n"
	.string "哎呀！我才不说体重呢！$"

Route105_Text_ImaniIntro:
	.string "蓝蓝的天空……\n"
	.string "辽阔的大海……\l"
	.string "真平静……$"

Route105_Text_ImaniDefeated:
	.string "我躺着躺着就输了！$"

Route105_Text_ImaniPostBattle:
	.string "真希望有人说和我在一起\n"
	.string "很放松。呵呵。$"

Route105_Text_AndresIntro:
	.string "我相信大海对我们\n"
	.string "隐藏着秘密。$"

Route105_Text_AndresDefeated:
	.string "是啊……\n"
	.string "我果然不擅长对战……$"

Route105_Text_AndresPostBattle:
	.string "世界上一定还有很多\n"
	.string "未发现的秘密。\p"
	.string "我要把它们全找出来！$"

Route105_Text_AndresRegister:
	.string "嗯？我这么弱，你也愿意\n"
	.string "把我登记进导航吗？$"

Route105_Text_AndresRematchIntro:
	.string "我说过我很弱的……\n"
	.string "你确定要打吗？$"

Route105_Text_AndresRematchDefeated:
	.string "是啊……\n"
	.string "我就知道赢不了。$"

Route105_Text_AndresRematchPostBattle:
	.string "对战我或许很弱，但我的\n"
	.string "探索热情谁也比不上。\p"
	.string "我要游遍全世界的海！$"

Route105_Text_JosueIntro:
	.string "我游得累坏了。\n"
	.string "就是不太习惯。\p"
	.string "想打一场换换节奏！$"

Route105_Text_JosueDefeated:
	.string "我在海里打，所以输了。$"

Route105_Text_JosuePostBattle:
	.string "是啊，对我来说天空比\n"
	.string "大海更适合我。$"

Route106_Text_ElliotIntro:
	.string "你更喜欢在海里钓鱼，\n"
	.string "还是在河里？$"

Route106_Text_ElliotDefeated:
	.string "就像深海钓到大鱼一样，\n"
	.string "我输得很壮观！$"

Route106_Text_ElliotPostBattle:
	.string "不管在海里还是河里，\n"
	.string "钓鱼都是最棒的。\l"
	.string "你也这么觉得吧？$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRegister:
	.string "钓鱼很棒，对战也很棒。\n"
	.string "不介意的话，再见一面吧？$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRematchIntro:
	.string "我钓鱼抓到了一堆宝可梦。\n"
	.string "让你看看精彩的对战！$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRematchDefeated:
	.string "我又输得很壮观！$"

Route106_Text_ElliotRematchPostBattle:
	.string "不管输赢，宝可梦最棒！\n"
	.string "你也这么觉得吧？$"

Route106_Text_NedIntro:
	.string "人想去厕所的时候怎么办？\p"
	.string "要是钓鱼时钓到大家伙，\n"
	.string "我却去厕所了可就……$"

Route106_Text_NedDefeated:
	.string "我因为忍着不去厕所，\n"
	.string "所以输了……$"

Route106_Text_NedPostBattle:
	.string "哦，不！我有预感要钓到\n"
	.string "大家伙了！$"

Route106_Text_DouglasIntro:
	.string "哈哈哈！我跑步很烂，\n"
	.string "但在水里你可追不上我！$"

Route106_Text_DouglasDefeated:
	.string "我认输！$"

Route106_Text_DouglasPostBattle:
	.string "游泳比赛我可不会输……$"

Route106_Text_KylaIntro:
	.string "大海是我家后院。\n"
	.string "我可不会因为你是小孩\l"
	.string "就手下留情！$"

Route106_Text_KylaDefeated:
	.string "你该不会是对我\n"
	.string "手下留情了吧？$"

Route106_Text_KylaPostBattle:
	.string "随波漂流……\n"
	.string "太棒了！你也试试？$"

Route107_Text_DarrinIntro:
	.string "呼啊……\p"
	.string "漂在波浪上，我一定是\n"
	.string "不知不觉睡着了。$"

Route107_Text_DarrinDefeated:
	.string "啊哈哈，我输了……\n"
	.string "我想我要打个盹……$"

Route107_Text_DarrinPostBattle:
	.string "被波浪托着摇晃——\n"
	.string "就像睡在柔软舒适的床上。$"

Route107_Text_TonyIntro:
	.string "大海就像我的后院。\n"
	.string "来对战吧！$"

Route107_Text_TonyDefeated:
	.string "我在主场输了……\n"
	.string "太震惊了！$"

Route107_Text_TonyPostBattle:
	.string "我满怀梦想地游在大海上……\p"
	.string "这就是歌啊！\n"
	.string "总之，我再游一会儿。$"

Route107_Text_TonyRegister:
	.string "你把我震得骨头都麻了！\n"
	.string "那就让你记住我……$"

Route107_Text_TonyRematchIntro:
	.string "在广阔的大海里游泳，\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦变强了！$"

Route107_Text_TonyRematchDefeated:
	.string "太震惊了！\p"
	.string "我的宝可梦变强了，\n"
	.string "我作为训练家却还是那么弱！$"

Route107_Text_TonyRematchPostBattle:
	.string "对战中领悟的东西会让你\n"
	.string "成为更强的训练家。\l"
	.string "这是波浪教我的。$"

Route107_Text_DeniseIntro:
	.string "你知道一个叫\n"
	.string "武斗镇的小镇吗？$"

Route107_Text_DeniseDefeated:
	.string "我讨厌这样！$"

Route107_Text_DenisePostBattle:
	.string "武斗镇的会馆里最近\n"
	.string "流行一句怪话。$"

Route107_Text_BethIntro:
	.string "你想和我对战？\n"
	.string "好啊，我奉陪！$"

Route107_Text_BethDefeated:
	.string "我还是不够强。$"

Route107_Text_BethPostBattle:
	.string "我觉得你会越来越强。\n"
	.string "我也要加油！$"

Route107_Text_LisaIntro:
	.string "莉莎：我们姐弟来\n"
	.string "挑战你！$"

Route107_Text_LisaDefeated:
	.string "莉莎：厉害。\n"
	.string "你的实力完全是另一个层次。$"

Route107_Text_LisaPostBattle:
	.string "莉莎：你有愿意陪你\n"
	.string "去海边的朋友吗？$"

Route107_Text_LisaNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "莉莎：想和我们打的话，\n"
	.string "多带些宝可梦来。$"

Route107_Text_RayIntro:
	.string "RAY：我和姐姐经常一起\n"
	.string "用宝可梦对战。\p"
	.string "我总是输，但二对二\n"
	.string "我们一定能赢你！$"

Route107_Text_RayDefeated:
	.string "RAY：哇，你的水平\n"
	.string "比我们高多了！$"

Route107_Text_RayPostBattle:
	.string "RAY：我的宝可梦是姐姐给的。\n"
	.string "我养大了它，\l"
	.string "现在是我重要的伙伴！$"

Route107_Text_RayNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "RAY：想和我们打的话，\n"
	.string "多带些宝可梦来吧！$"

Route107_Text_CamronIntro:
	.string "我正在参加铁人三项，\n"
	.string "可一点也不累！$"

Route107_Text_CamronDefeated:
	.string "累死我了……$"

Route107_Text_CamronPostBattle:
	.string "之后我还要游泳和跑步。\p"
	.string "我还撑得住吗？$"

Route108_Text_JeromeIntro:
	.string "我的梦想是游遍\n"
	.string "全世界的七大海！$"

Route108_Text_JeromeDefeated:
	.string "这样可游不了\n"
	.string "七大海啊……$"

Route108_Text_JeromePostBattle:
	.string "和海洋宝可梦一起玩，\n"
	.string "也是游泳的一大乐趣！$"

Route108_Text_MatthewIntro:
	.string "喂，你好！你也要去\n"
	.string "那艘废弃船吗？$"

Route108_Text_MatthewDefeated:
	.string "我沉下去了！\n"
	.string "咕噜……咕噜……$"

Route108_Text_MatthewPostBattle:
	.string "还有人会进那艘\n"
	.string "废弃船里面呢。$"

Route108_Text_TaraIntro:
	.string "我那个爱撒谎的男朋友说\n"
	.string "我穿比基尼很好看……$"

Route108_Text_TaraDefeated:
	.string "哼！$"

Route108_Text_TaraPostBattle:
	.string "就算是谎话，我也喜欢\n"
	.string "被人夸好看……\l"
	.string "女孩子真复杂……$"

Route108_Text_MissyIntro:
	.string "我最爱大海！\n"
	.string "游泳时什么烦恼都忘了！$"

Route108_Text_MissyDefeated:
	.string "一输对战我就\n"
	.string "压力好大！$"

Route108_Text_MissyPostBattle:
	.string "用游泳来消除压力！\n"
	.string "多健康啊！$"

Route108_Text_CoryIntro:
	.string "我最爱水属性宝可梦。\n"
	.string "其他宝可梦我也爱！$"

Route108_Text_CoryDefeated:
	.string "哇！我输了！\n"
	.string "哇！哇！$"

Route108_Text_CoryPostBattle:
	.string "大喊对我有好处！\n"
	.string "能让我振作起来！$"

Route108_Text_CoryRegister:
	.string "我也爱强大的训练家！\n"
	.string "把我登记进导航吧！$"

Route108_Text_CoryRematchIntro:
	.string "不管输赢，我都爱在\n"
	.string "海里对战！$"

Route108_Text_CoryRematchDefeated:
	.string "哇！我又输了！\n"
	.string "哇！哇！$"

Route108_Text_CoryRematchPostBattle:
	.string "遇到难题时，\n"
	.string "就朝大海喊一喊！$"

Route108_Text_CarolinaIntro:
	.string "我对我的宝可梦充满自信。\n"
	.string "让你见识一场快速的对战！$"

Route108_Text_CarolinaDefeated:
	.string "一点也不可爱。$"

Route108_Text_CarolinaPostBattle:
	.string "既然这样待在海边，我倒是\n"
	.string "想穿上粉色荷叶边泳装……$"

Route109_Text_DavidIntro:
	.string "嘿呀！看我的腹肌！\n"
	.string "这才叫“有型”！$"

Route109_Text_DavidDefeated:
	.string "哎呀！\n"
	.string "全垮了！$"

Route109_Text_DavidPostBattle:
	.string "嘿呀！\p"
	.string "我练出来的腹肌和宝可梦\n"
	.string "对战可没有关系！$"

Route109_Text_AliceIntro:
	.string "你做好防晒了吗？$"

Route109_Text_AliceDefeated:
	.string "疼、疼、疼！$"

Route109_Text_AlicePostBattle:
	.string "脸颊最容易晒伤了！$"

Route109_Text_HueyIntro:
	.string "我在世界各地的港口停靠过，\n"
	.string "但凯那市是最好的。$"

Route109_Text_HueyDefeated:
	.string "你最棒！$"

Route109_Text_HueyPostBattle:
	.string "最好的港口里遇见了\n"
	.string "最好的训练家……$"

Route109_Text_EdmondIntro:
	.string "呃……\n"
	.string "要和我对战？$"

Route109_Text_EdmondDefeated:
	.string "呃……哦哦哦……\n"
	.string "呃……$"

Route109_Text_EdmondPostBattle:
	.string "我平时比这强多了！\n"
	.string "只是晕船晕得厉害！\p"
	.string "我明明是水手……$"

Route109_Text_RickyIntro:
	.string "我口渴了……好想去热之家\n"
	.string "喝杯汽水……$"

Route109_Text_RickyDefeated:
	.string "唔……$"

Route109_Text_RickyPostBattle:
	.string "我饿了……我的泳圈\n"
	.string "看着像个大甜甜圈……$"

Route109_Text_RickyRegister:
	.string "等我不那么渴了，\n"
	.string "再和我打一场好吗？$"

Route109_Text_RickyRematchIntro:
	.string "我饿了，但还是有\n"
	.string "力气对战！$"

Route109_Text_RickyRematchDefeated:
	.string "我输了……\n"
	.string "因为饿着肚子……$"

Route109_Text_RickyRematchPostBattle:
	.string "在海边吃东西，\n"
	.string "什么都更好吃一点。$"

Route109_Text_LolaIntro:
	.string "沙滩伞看起来\n"
	.string "像不像一朵大花？$"

Route109_Text_LolaDefeated:
	.string "妈妈！$"

Route109_Text_LolaPostBattle:
	.string "从天上往下看沙滩，\n"
	.string "就像一个大花园！$"

Route109_Text_LolaRegister:
	.string "我？\n"
	.string "我每天都在这里！$"

Route109_Text_LolaRematchIntro:
	.string "我不会再输给你了！\n"
	.string "这就是我带着泳圈的原因！$"

Route109_Text_LolaRematchDefeated:
	.string "妈妈！$"

Route109_Text_LolaRematchPostBattle:
	.string "有泳圈在，我和宝可梦的\n"
	.string "可爱度都会大大提升！$"

Route109_Text_AustinaIntro:
	.string "没有泳圈我游不了泳，\n"
	.string "但宝可梦对战我可不会输！$"

Route109_Text_AustinaDefeated:
	.string "难道我输了是因为\n"
	.string "带着泳圈？$"

Route109_Text_AustinaPostBattle:
	.string "泳圈是我的时尚单品。\n"
	.string "不带着它我可不能见人。$"

Route109_Text_GwenIntro:
	.string "你好，大训练家。\n"
	.string "能和我对战吗？$"

Route109_Text_GwenDefeated:
	.string "哦，你好强。$"

Route109_Text_GwenPostBattle:
	.string "你是怎么变得这么强的？$"

Route109_Text_CarterIntro:
	.string "哇哈哈！这小子要\n"
	.string "大干一场了！$"

Route109_Text_CarterDefeated:
	.string "这小子刚输了一场……$"

Route109_Text_CarterPostBattle:
	.string "这小子觉得你很厉害。\n"
	.string "不，你以后会更厉害！$"

Route109_Text_PaulIntro:
	.string "保罗：真是扫兴。\p"
	.string "希望你别打扰我们\n"
	.string "宝贵的二人时光。$"

Route109_Text_PaulDefeated:
	.string "保罗：好吧，我认输。$"

Route109_Text_PaulPostBattle:
	.string "保罗：好吧，别告诉别人\n"
	.string "我们在这里。\l"
	.string "这是我们两人的世界！$"

Route109_Text_PaulNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "保罗：我们深深地相爱。\n"
	.string "所以我们让宝可梦一起对战。$"

Route109_Text_MelIntro:
	.string "梅尔：我们真的非常相爱。\n"
	.string "我们的恋爱正让丰缘升温！$"

Route109_Text_MelDefeated:
	.string "梅尔：我们输了，都怪我！\n"
	.string "保罗会讨厌我的！$"

Route109_Text_MelPostBattle:
	.string "梅尔：那个，保罗，\n"
	.string "你生我气了吗？别生气嘛。$"

Route109_Text_MelNotEnoughPokemon:
	.string "梅尔：我们真的深深地相爱。\n"
	.string "所以我们让宝可梦\l"
	.string "一起对战。$"

Route109_Text_ChandlerIntro:
	.string "当当！看！\n"
	.string "我的泳圈是圆的！$"

Route109_Text_ChandlerDefeated:
	.string "哎呀呀！\n"
	.string "太可惜了！$"

Route109_Text_ChandlerPostBattle:
	.string "我还给你看了我圆圆的\n"
	.string "泳圈呢……$"

Route109_Text_HaileyIntro:
	.string "我不会游泳，\n"
	.string "所以在假装游泳。$"

Route109_Text_HaileyDefeated:
	.string "果然！\n"
	.string "我就知道赢不了。$"

Route109_Text_HaileyPostBattle:
	.string "等我学会游泳，\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦也会变强吧。$"

Route109_Text_ElijahIntro:
	.string "像我这么有男子气概的人，\n"
	.string "这种宝可梦最合适了！$"

Route109_Text_ElijahDefeated:
	.string "就算输了我也很酷吧？$"

Route109_Text_ElijahPostBattle:
	.string "像我这么有男子气概的人，\n"
	.string "港口最合适了！\p"
	.string "我决定去凯那市。$"

Route110_Text_JacobIntro:
	.string "喂！小心点！\n"
	.string "看来你还不习惯自行车比赛。$"

Route110_Text_JacobDefeated:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "我的刹车失灵了！$"

Route110_Text_JacobPostBattle:
	.string "爆胎和刹车故障会\n"
	.string "造成重伤！\l"
	.string "要检查好你的自行车！$"

Route110_Text_AnthonyIntro:
	.string "喂，你！\n"
	.string "跟得上我的速度吗？$"

Route110_Text_AnthonyDefeated:
	.string "彻底失败！$"

Route110_Text_AnthonyPostBattle:
	.string "光靠速度赢不了宝可梦对战。\n"
	.string "我得重新想想……$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminIntro:
	.string "自行车骑得快也别慌！$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminDefeated:
	.string "宝可梦对战时\n"
	.string "我不该慌张……$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminPostBattle:
	.string "不用慌张也不用着急。\n"
	.string "慢慢来，时间多的是。$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRegister:
	.string "我会不慌不忙地继续前进。\n"
	.string "想打的话就叫我一声。$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchIntro:
	.string "你是不是骑得太快了？\n"
	.string "慢慢来，打一场吧。$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchDefeated:
	.string "我没慌张，但还是输了……$"

Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchPostBattle:
	.string "不用慌张也不用着急。\n"
	.string "慢慢来，时间多的是。$"

Route110_Text_AbigailIntro:
	.string "铁人三项非常艰难。\p"
	.string "要完成游泳、自行车\n"
	.string "和跑步三个项目。$"

Route110_Text_AbigailDefeated:
	.string "宝可梦对战也很难！$"

Route110_Text_AbigailPostBattle:
	.string "我累坏了，需要休息。\n"
	.string "好好休息很重要。$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRegister:
	.string "说起来，我很喜欢你！\n"
	.string "下次在自行车道再见吧。$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRematchIntro:
	.string "一边骑车一边对战，\n"
	.string "是不是很酷？$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRematchDefeated:
	.string "哇……\n"
	.string "你怎么这么强？$"

Route110_Text_AbigailRematchPostBattle:
	.string "你是在冲纪录吗？\p"
	.string "要是拖了你后腿，\n"
	.string "真抱歉！$"

Route110_Text_JasmineIntro:
	.string "我一直没停车地骑。\n"
	.string "我的大腿硬得像石头！$"

Route110_Text_JasmineDefeated:
	.string "我怕肌肉抽筋……$"

Route110_Text_JasminePostBattle:
	.string "哦，你已经有道馆徽章了？\n"
	.string "难怪这么强！$"

Route110_Text_EdwardIntro:
	.string "我已经预见了你的意图！\n"
	.string "我不可能输！$"

Route110_Text_EdwardDefeated:
	.string "我没能预言到自己的败北！$"

Route110_Text_EdwardPostBattle:
	.string "我看到你的未来……\p"
	.string "嗯……\n"
	.string "我看到了一道闪光……$"

Route110_Text_JaclynIntro:
	.string "啊哈哈哈！\n"
	.string "让你见识我的奇迹！$"

Route110_Text_JaclynDefeated:
	.string "我奇迹般地输了！$"

Route110_Text_JaclynPostBattle:
	.string "你赢了只是因为那是奇迹！\n"
	.string "对，是奇迹！\l"
	.string "别以为你能一直赢！$"

Route110_Text_EdwinIntro:
	.string "能让我看看你的宝可梦吗？\n"
	.string "就看一眼！$"

Route110_Text_EdwinDefeated:
	.string "我还想完成\n"
	.string "我的收藏……$"

Route110_Text_EdwinPostBattle:
	.string "一看到不认识的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我收藏家的热情就燃起来了！$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRegister:
	.string "我也喜欢收集\n"
	.string "训练家导航登记……$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRematchIntro:
	.string "嗨，抓到新宝可梦了吗？\p"
	.string "能让我看看你的宝可梦吗？\n"
	.string "就看一眼！$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRematchDefeated:
	.string "你的宝可梦……\n"
	.string "真让人羡慕。$"

Route110_Text_EdwinRematchPostBattle:
	.string "哦，我真想把所有稀有的\n"
	.string "宝可梦都收归我有！$"

Route110_Text_DaleIntro:
	.string "喂！\n"
	.string "别这样从后面偷偷靠近我！$"

Route110_Text_DaleDefeated:
	.string "我输了！\n"
	.string "可恶！$"

Route110_Text_DalePostBattle:
	.string "钓鱼全靠专注。\n"
	.string "必须盯着浮漂。$"

Route110_Text_IsabelIntro:
	.string "啊哈哈哈！我无论去哪都要\n"
	.string "展示我可爱的宝可梦。$"

Route110_Text_IsabelDefeated:
	.string "哎呀，这可不行。$"

Route110_Text_IsabelPostBattle:
	.string "与其对战，不如去\n"
	.string "粉丝俱乐部展示宝可梦吧。$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRegister:
	.string "我可还没拿出展示宝可梦的\n"
	.string "真本事呢。\p"
	.string "以后要常让你当我的观众！$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRematchIntro:
	.string "啊哈哈哈！我很乐意随你\n"
	.string "想看多少次就展示多少次！$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRematchDefeated:
	.string "哎呀，这可不行。$"

Route110_Text_IsabelRematchPostBattle:
	.string "我想我永远也停不下\n"
	.string "展示宝可梦这件事。\p"
	.string "不过我也喜欢对战！$"

Route110_Text_TimmyIntro:
	.string "我在这附近的草丛里\n"
	.string "找到了很酷的宝可梦！$"

Route110_Text_TimmyDefeated:
	.string "光是酷还赢不了……$"

Route110_Text_TimmyPostBattle:
	.string "用刚抓到的宝可梦对战\n"
	.string "好难啊。$"

Route110_Text_AlyssaIntro:
	.string "我从自行车道上摔下来了……\p"
	.string "就用对战来忘掉\n"
	.string "这份羞耻吧！$"

Route110_Text_AlyssaDefeated:
	.string "哎呀！\n"
	.string "结果我输了！$"

Route110_Text_AlyssaPostBattle:
	.string "摔倒……又输掉……\n"
	.string "我真是太丢脸了！$"

Route110_Text_JosephIntro:
	.string "好！全速前进！跟不上\n"
	.string "节奏的话就等着掉队吧！$"

Route110_Text_JosephDefeated:
	.string "你倒是很跟得上节奏……$"

Route110_Text_JosephPostBattle:
	.string "这不会打垮我！\n"
	.string "输让我变得更强！$"

Route110_Text_KalebIntro:
	.string "可爱的宝可梦互相帮助……\n"
	.string "没有比这更可爱的画面了！$"

Route110_Text_KalebDefeated:
	.string "你就一点同情心都没有吗？$"

Route110_Text_KalebPostBattle:
	.string "好了好了，你们已经\n"
	.string "做得很好了，小家伙们。$"

Route111_Text_DrewIntro:
	.string "哦，嘿！防沙镜挺适合你。\n"
	.string "不过我觉得戴在我身上更好。\p"
	.string "就用对战来决定谁更合适吧！$"

Route111_Text_DrewDefeat:
	.string "戴着防沙镜，我看不清\n"
	.string "两边发生了什么。$"

Route111_Text_DrewPostBattle:
	.string "有了防沙镜就能穿过沙暴。\n"
	.string "真让人高兴！$"

Route111_Text_HeidiIntro:
	.string "我正在沙漠里野餐。\p"
	.string "训练家到处都有，\n"
	.string "所以我也能在这里享受对战！$"

Route111_Text_HeidiDefeat:
	.string "哦哦！你好过分！$"

Route111_Text_HeidiPostBattle:
	.string "在沙暴中对战时，\n"
	.string "要留意宝可梦的HP。\p"
	.string "不管好的话它可是会倒下的！$"

Route111_Text_BeauIntro:
	.string "戴上这副防沙镜，\n"
	.string "我感觉自己像超级英雄。\l"
	.string "现在没人能赢我！$"

Route111_Text_BeauDefeat:
	.string "光靠气势赢不了……$"

Route111_Text_BeauPostBattle:
	.string "总有一天我要成为英雄。\n"
	.string "我要更努力，让我和宝可梦\l"
	.string "都变强。$"

Route111_Text_BeckyIntro:
	.string "听说沙漠里能找到化石。\n"
	.string "会在哪里呢？$"

Route111_Text_BeckyDefeat:
	.string "我差了一点……$"

Route111_Text_BeckyPostBattle:
	.string "如果沙漠里能找到化石，\n"
	.string "那这里以前一定是海。$"

Route111_Text_DustyIntro:
	.string "三十年来我一直在\n"
	.string "寻找古代遗迹！\l"
	.string "你要挑战我？$"

Route111_Text_DustyDefeat:
	.string "我一直在寻找遗迹，\n"
	.string "却没寻找强大的宝可梦。$"

Route111_Text_DustyPostBattle:
	.string "三十年来我一直在\n"
	.string "寻找古代遗迹！\p"
	.string "不对，等等，是四十年吗？\n"
	.string "到底是哪个来着？$"

Route111_Text_DustyRegister:
	.string "我从没找过\n"
	.string "什么强大的宝可梦。\p"
	.string "可是不知为何，我真的\n"
	.string "很喜欢导航。$"

Route111_Text_DustyRematchIntro:
	.string "三十年来我一直在\n"
	.string "寻找古代遗迹！\p"
	.string "不对，是四十年吗？\n"
	.string "总之，你要挑战我？$"

Route111_Text_DustyRematchDefeat:
	.string "我没找到遗迹，也没找到\n"
	.string "强大的宝可梦……$"

Route111_Text_DustyPostRematch:
	.string "三十年来我一直在\n"
	.string "寻找古代遗迹！\p"
	.string "不对，是四十年吗？\p"
	.string "嗯……也许都五十年了……\n"
	.string "我到底找了多久？$"

Route111_Text_TravisIntro:
	.string "我精力充沛！\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦也很有活力！$"

Route111_Text_TravisDefeat:
	.string "我的宝可梦没精神了……$"

Route111_Text_TravisPostBattle:
	.string "看到充满活力的训练家，\n"
	.string "我就忍不住想多看两眼。$"

Route111_Text_IreneIntro:
	.string "我不知道你要去哪，\n"
	.string "不过要不要打一场？$"

Route111_Text_IreneDefeat:
	.string "哦，你强得让人讨厌！$"

Route111_Text_IrenePostBattle:
	.string "我在想要不要去烟突山，\n"
	.string "不过这里的景色也不错。$"

Route111_Text_DaisukeIntro:
	.string "为了锻炼自己，我见到\n"
	.string "谁就挑战谁！$"

Route111_Text_DaisukeDefeat:
	.string "我认输了！$"

Route111_Text_DaisukePostBattle:
	.string "我只能不断训练，直到\n"
	.string "能打败你这样的强手。$"

Route111_Text_WiltonIntro:
	.string "让我看看你把宝可梦\n"
	.string "锻炼得多强了。$"

Route111_Text_WiltonDefeat:
	.string "我明白了，你确实把它们\n"
	.string "锻炼得相当强。$"

Route111_Text_WiltonPostBattle:
	.string "宝可梦和训练家都能从\n"
	.string "对战中学习很多。\p"
	.string "重要的是就算输了\n"
	.string "也绝不放弃。$"

Route111_Text_WiltonRegister:
	.string "你的训练方式里\n"
	.string "有很多值得学习的地方。\p"
	.string "如果方便的话，\n"
	.string "我想再和你打一场。$"

Route111_Text_WiltonRematchIntro:
	.string "我们在这里训练，\n"
	.string "是为了更上一层楼。\l"
	.string "留下来和我们一起练吧！$"

Route111_Text_WiltonRematchDefeat:
	.string "哦，你挺不错！$"

Route111_Text_WiltonPostRematch:
	.string "既然你这么强，就该\n"
	.string "以宝可梦联盟为目标。$"

Route111_Text_BrookeIntro:
	.string "哦，你的宝可梦看起来\n"
	.string "像认真的演员。\l"
	.string "我必须要请你一场对战。$"

Route111_Text_BrookeDefeat:
	.string "它们不只是看起来强，\n"
	.string "是真的强！$"

Route111_Text_BrookePostBattle:
	.string "我以为自己很用心在培养\n"
	.string "宝可梦，可还是差得远。$"

Route111_Text_BrookeRegister:
	.string "真希望能和更多像你\n"
	.string "这样强的人做朋友！$"

Route111_Text_BrookeRematchIntro:
	.string "教什么招式，会让宝可梦\n"
	.string "变强或变弱。\p"
	.string "你的宝可梦都会些什么招式？$"

Route111_Text_BrookeRematchDefeat:
	.string "你教了它们好招式！$"

Route111_Text_BrookePostRematch:
	.string "也许我该让宝可梦\n"
	.string "晚点进化，\l"
	.string "先学会更好的招式……$"

Route111_Text_CeliaIntro:
	.string "我不该来这种地方\n"
	.string "野餐的！$"

Route111_Text_CeliaDefeat:
	.string "呜！\n"
	.string "我真不该来！$"

Route111_Text_CeliaPostBattle:
	.string "这样的沙暴里，就算戴着\n"
	.string "防沙镜也铺不好野餐垫……$"

Route111_Text_BryanIntro:
	.string "你有多强？\n"
	.string "我们要揭开这个秘密！$"

Route111_Text_BryanDefeat:
	.string "哦！你的实力！\n"
	.string "笼罩在谜团之中！$"

Route111_Text_BryanPostBattle:
	.string "这片沙漠把谜团藏在\n"
	.string "流动的沙子里！$"

Route111_Text_BrandenIntro:
	.string "你要是输给我，\n"
	.string "我就分你半个三明治。$"

Route111_Text_BrandenDefeat:
	.string "啧！我还以为三明治\n"
	.string "够贿赂你了……$"

Route111_Text_BrandenPostBattle:
	.string "我的穿山鼠最爱吃\n"
	.string "我做的三明治。$"

Route111_Text_TyronIntro:
	.string "这是我最喜欢的\n"
	.string "那类宝可梦！$"

Route111_Text_TyronDefeat:
	.string "等等！\n"
	.string "你仔细看我的宝可梦了吗？$"

Route111_Text_TyronPostBattle:
	.string "对战时，我最喜欢\n"
	.string "展示我的宝可梦。\p"
	.string "我敢说大家都这么想！$"

Route111_Text_CelinaIntro:
	.string "教我怎样给生活\n"
	.string "加点刺激吧。$"

Route111_Text_CelinaDefeat:
	.string "哎……呀……\n"
	.string "刺激过头了。$"

Route111_Text_CelinaPostBattle:
	.string "我的心跳还在加速。\n"
	.string "你真是位了不起的训练家。$"

Route111_Text_HaydenIntro:
	.string "像饿成我这样的人，\n"
	.string "可没空手下留情！$"

Route111_Text_HaydenDefeat:
	.string "唔……$"

Route111_Text_HaydenPostBattle:
	.string "我的肚子在叫！\n"
	.string "也许我可以烤些树果……$"

Route111_Text_BiancaIntro:
	.string "你是从紫堇市来的？\n"
	.string "那你应该元气满满！$"

Route111_Text_BiancaDefeat:
	.string "哦啦啦！\n"
	.string "这招我可招架不住！$"

Route111_Text_BiancaPostBattle:
	.string "这条路……\n"
	.string "你要走的路还很长。$"

Route112_Text_BriceIntro:
	.string "哈哈哈哈哈！\n"
	.string "来打一场吧？\l"
	.string "你和我！\l"
	.string "哈哈哈哈哈！$"

Route112_Text_BriceDefeat:
	.string "我输了！\n"
	.string "哈哈哈哈哈！$"

Route112_Text_BricePostBattle:
	.string "哈哈！有东西飞进鼻子了！\n"
	.string "哈——嚏！$"

Route112_Text_TrentIntro:
	.string "我在山里上上下下，\n"
	.string "腿脚结实得很。\p"
	.string "可不会轻易发软，\n"
	.string "朋友！$"

Route112_Text_TrentDefeat:
	.string "哎哟！我的腿抽筋了！$"

Route112_Text_TrentPostBattle:
	.string "试试背着重重的背包\n"
	.string "在山路上来回走。\p"
	.string "朋友，那会让你的身体\n"
	.string "变得非常结实。$"

Route112_Text_TrentRegister:
	.string "哎哟，我的腿抽筋了。\n"
	.string "能帮我从背包里拿点绷带吗？\p"
	.string "不，那是我的导航！\n"
	.string "好吧，我登记你。$"

Route112_Text_TrentRematchIntro:
	.string "我一直靠登山保持状态。\n"
	.string "力量我多得是！$"

Route112_Text_TrentRematchDefeat:
	.string "我的力量被压倒了？$"

Route112_Text_TrentRematchPostBattle:
	.string "听说烟突山顶上有\n"
	.string "很强的训练家。\p"
	.string "我打算上去挑战他们！$"

Route112_Text_LarryIntro:
	.string "我很强。\n"
	.string "输了也不哭。$"

Route112_Text_LarryDefeat:
	.string "哇——！$"

Route112_Text_LarryPostBattle:
	.string "我不是因为想妈妈才哭的！\n"
	.string "抽泣……$"

Route112_Text_CarolIntro:
	.string "野餐的时候，\n"
	.string "当然要唱歌！\l"
	.string "来，和我一起唱！$"

Route112_Text_CarolDefeat:
	.string "哦，你好强！$"

Route112_Text_CarolPostBattle:
	.string "唱歌也好，宝可梦也好，\n"
	.string "好坏都不重要。\p"
	.string "玩得最开心的人才是赢家！$"

Route112_Text_BryantIntro:
	.string "我在热焰小径抓到了火热的\n"
	.string "宝可梦！来看看！$"

Route112_Text_BryantDefeat:
	.string "真是一场颠簸的旅程！$"

Route112_Text_BryantPostBattle:
	.string "我喜欢你的对战方式。\n"
	.string "有种独特的风范。$"

Route112_Text_ShaylaIntro:
	.string "哦，你真是位可爱的训练家！\n"
	.string "来场浪漫的对战吧！\l"
	.string "我还挺厉害的！$"

Route112_Text_ShaylaDefeat:
	.string "哦，你好强！\n"
	.string "真让我吃惊！$"

Route112_Text_ShaylaPostBattle:
	.string "你现在忙吗？\n"
	.string "我在想也许可以马上再打……\l"
	.string "不过你要是忙就算了。$"

Route113_Text_JaylenIntro:
	.string "你猜猜为什么这附近\n"
	.string "这么凉快？$"

Route113_Text_JaylenDefeat:
	.string "呃！\n"
	.string "好臭！$"

Route113_Text_JaylenPostBattle:
	.string "火山灰挡住了阳光，\n"
	.string "所以这里不怎么热。\p"
	.string "这对我来说正好——\n"
	.string "我最怕热了！$"

Route113_Text_DillonIntro:
	.string "火山喷发证明\n"
	.string "大地还活着。$"

Route113_Text_DillonDefeat:
	.string "你真不是一般地强！$"

Route113_Text_DillonPostBattle:
	.string "哎哟！我看不见了！\n"
	.string "火山灰进了我的睫毛！\p"
	.string "懂了吗？火山灰和睫毛？\p"
	.string "好吧，这笑话很烂，抱歉……$"

Route113_Text_MadelineIntro:
	.string "我用这把阳伞替我\n"
	.string "亲爱的赫拉克罗斯\l"
	.string "挡住脏兮兮的火山灰。$"

Route113_Text_MadelineDefeat:
	.string "呼、呼……\n"
	.string "我累坏了……$"

Route113_Text_MadelinePostBattle:
	.string "你真的很厉害。\n"
	.string "我不得不说佩服！$"

Route113_Text_MadelineRegister:
	.string "来，躲到我的阳伞下。\n"
	.string "让我把你登记进导航。$"

Route113_Text_MadelineRematchIntro:
	.string "哦，你好，好久不见。\n"
	.string "能邀请你打一场吗？$"

Route113_Text_MadelineRematchDefeat:
	.string "哦，真了不起！$"

Route113_Text_MadelinePostRematch:
	.string "你依然那么厉害。\n"
	.string "我不得不说佩服！$"

Route113_Text_LaoIntro:
	.string "我从灰烬中跃出！嘿呀！\n"
	.string "我来挑战你！$"

Route113_Text_LaoDefeat:
	.string "我光荣地认输！$"

Route113_Text_LaoPostBattle:
	.string "我还得磨炼隐遁之术。\n"
	.string "就此别过。$"

Route113_Text_LaoRegister:
	.string "呀啊！见识古代忍者的\n"
	.string "导航登记之术吧！$"

Route113_Text_LaoRematchIntro:
	.string "我从灰烬中跃出！嘿呀！\n"
	.string "我来挑战你！$"

Route113_Text_LaoRematchDefeat:
	.string "我光荣地认输！$"

Route113_Text_LaoPostRematch:
	.string "我无懈可击的隐遁之术\n"
	.string "败给了不成熟的对战技巧……\p"
	.string "就此别过。$"

Route113_Text_LungIntro:
	.string "谢谢你找到我！\n"
	.string "不过我们还是得对战！$"

Route113_Text_LungDefeat:
	.string "我要用忍术对付你……\n"
	.string "“火山灰旋涡之衣”！\p"
	.string "……什么？\n"
	.string "已经结束了？$"

Route113_Text_LungPostBattle:
	.string "躲藏最难受的是什么？\n"
	.string "没人来会很孤单。$"

Route113_Text_ToriIntro:
	.string "托莉：我们两个都在收集灰。\n"
	.string "也会用宝可梦对战。$"

Route113_Text_ToriDefeat:
	.string "托莉：我们输了……好无聊，\n"
	.string "我再去收集点灰。$"

Route113_Text_ToriPostBattle:
	.string "托莉：我们有多少灰了？\n"
	.string "希望能做个白笛子。$"

Route113_Text_ToriNotEnoughMons:
	.string "托莉：我们想二对二打。\n"
	.string "不然我们会输！$"

Route113_Text_TiaIntro:
	.string "TIA：我们两个都在收集灰。\n"
	.string "也会用宝可梦对战。$"

Route113_Text_TiaDefeat:
	.string "TIA：我们赢不了……好无聊，\n"
	.string "我再去收集点灰。$"

Route113_Text_TiaPostBattle:
	.string "TIA：我们的灰好多！\n"
	.string "我觉得够做白笛子了！$"

Route113_Text_TiaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "TIA：我们想二对二打。\n"
	.string "不然我们赢不了！$"

Route113_Text_CobyIntro:
	.string "哼，有这双翅膀，\n"
	.string "我一扇就能把你扇飞！$"

Route113_Text_CobyDefeat:
	.string "啊……什么？$"

Route113_Text_CobyPostBattle:
	.string "这么容易就被打倒，\n"
	.string "我都不知道该说什么了……$"

Route113_Text_SophieIntro:
	.string "这里的温暖让我昏昏欲睡。\n"
	.string "和我对战吧，好让我醒着。$"

Route113_Text_SophieDefeat:
	.string "这是梦。\n"
	.string "我确信……$"

Route113_Text_SophiePostBattle:
	.string "输掉让我火大……\n"
	.string "我就这样睡在这里了！\l"
	.string "呼……$"

Route113_Text_LawrenceIntro:
	.string "你该不会也在\n"
	.string "收集火山灰吧？$"

Route113_Text_LawrenceDefeat:
	.string "嘿嘿。\n"
	.string "我们输得干干净净。$"

Route113_Text_LawrencePostBattle:
	.string "看来我也该躲到灰下去了。$"

Route113_Text_WyattIntro:
	.string "你、你要和我对战？\n"
	.string "我才刚抓到宝可梦啊？$"

Route113_Text_WyattDefeat:
	.string "你、你就这么高兴赢？\n"
	.string "对手只是我而已啊？$"

Route113_Text_WyattPostBattle:
	.string "哦，你现在想对输的人\n"
	.string "说两句了？\p"
	.string "你可真酷啊。哼！$"

Route114_Text_LennyIntro:
	.string "约德尔嗨呼！\p"
	.string "……\p"
	.string "这里没有回声，所以\n"
	.string "你得自己喊“约德尔嗨呼”！$"

Route114_Text_LennyDefeat:
	.string "约德尔嗨呼！$"

Route114_Text_LennyPostBattle:
	.string "我小时候以为有人\n"
	.string "在学我喊“约德尔嗨呼”。$"

Route114_Text_LucasIntro:
	.string "没做好准备的话，\n"
	.string "可别上山！$"

Route114_Text_LucasDefeat:
	.string "大山是无情的……$"

Route114_Text_LucasPostBattle:
	.string "到了冬天，暴风雪和雪崩\n"
	.string "会让大山变得致命。$"

Route114_Text_ShaneIntro:
	.string "露营真有趣！可以钓鱼、\n"
	.string "烤棉花糖、讲鬼故事！\p"
	.string "但最棒的还是宝可梦对战！$"

Route114_Text_ShaneDefeat:
	.string "太强了！$"

Route114_Text_ShanePostBattle:
	.string "能和宝可梦一起露营，\n"
	.string "我觉得太棒了。$"

Route114_Text_NancyIntro:
	.string "饭后要运动一下。\n"
	.string "来打一场吧！$"

Route114_Text_NancyDefeat:
	.string "哦，不！$"

Route114_Text_NancyPostBattle:
	.string "我刚吃了一顿美味的饭。\n"
	.string "有点想睡了……$"

Route114_Text_SteveIntro:
	.string "呵呵呵呵……\n"
	.string "想和我的宝可梦对战吗？$"

Route114_Text_SteveDefeat:
	.string "我、我的宝可梦……$"

Route114_Text_StevePostBattle:
	.string "凹凸不平又坚硬的巨大身体、\n"
	.string "巨大的角和凶狠的獠牙……\p"
	.string "呵呵呵呵……\n"
	.string "真想要一只那样的宝可梦……$"

Route114_Text_SteveRegister:
	.string "别忘了你对我做了什么！\n"
	.string "我要让你忘不掉！$"

Route114_Text_SteveRematchIntro:
	.string "呵呵呵呵……\n"
	.string "来吧，和我的宝可梦对战……$"

Route114_Text_SteveRematchDefeat:
	.string "能看到你的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我真是太幸运了……$"

Route114_Text_StevePostRematch:
	.string "呵呵呵呵……\p"
	.string "看到宝可梦对战，\n"
	.string "我就浑身发抖停不下来……$"

Route114_Text_BernieIntro:
	.string "点篝火时，一定要\n"
	.string "准备好水。$"

Route114_Text_BernieDefeat:
	.string "谢谢你浇灭我的火！$"

Route114_Text_BerniePostBattle:
	.string "在森林里用任何火，\n"
	.string "都真的要小心。\p"
	.string "千万别小看火的力量。$"

Route114_Text_BernieRegister:
	.string "你点燃了我的斗志。\n"
	.string "让我们互相登记吧！$"

Route114_Text_BernieRematchIntro:
	.string "你学会点篝火时要\n"
	.string "准备水了吗？$"

Route114_Text_BernieRematchDefeat:
	.string "看来我还没燃起来，\n"
	.string "就被浇灭了。$"

Route114_Text_BerniePostRematch:
	.string "在森林里用任何火，\n"
	.string "都真的要小心。\p"
	.string "千万别小看火的力量。$"

Route114_Text_ClaudeIntro:
	.string "要是比钓鱼，你根本不是\n"
	.string "我的对手。\l"
	.string "那就用宝可梦来吧！$"

Route114_Text_ClaudeDefeat:
	.string "要是钓鱼，我就赢了……$"

Route114_Text_ClaudePostBattle:
	.string "我打算去流星瀑布碰碰运气，\n"
	.string "钓个大家伙。\p"
	.string "那里一定有东西。\n"
	.string "我有预感。$"

Route114_Text_NolanIntro:
	.string "我喜欢钓鱼。但也喜欢对战！\p"
	.string "只要有人挑战我，\n"
	.string "就算在钓鱼我也会应战。$"

Route114_Text_NolanDefeat:
	.string "我喜欢对战，但这不代表\n"
	.string "我很擅长……$"

Route114_Text_NolanPostBattle:
	.string "这次一定行！\p"
	.string "我总是这么想，所以既放不下\n"
	.string "钓鱼，也放不下宝可梦。$"

Route114_Text_TyraIntro:
	.string "泰拉：好啊。\n"
	.string "我正好有心情。\l"
	.string "我来教教你宝可梦的事。$"

Route114_Text_TyraDefeat:
	.string "泰拉：多么惊人的对战风格！$"

Route114_Text_TyraPostBattle:
	.string "泰拉：我在教我的学妹\n"
	.string "艾薇关于宝可梦的事。$"

Route114_Text_TyraNotEnoughMons:
	.string "泰拉：呵呵……\n"
	.string "想和我们打的话，\l"
	.string "只带一只宝可梦可不够！$"

Route114_Text_IvyIntro:
	.string "艾薇：是谁教你宝可梦的？$"

Route114_Text_IvyDefeat:
	.string "艾薇：多么惊人的对战风格！$"

Route114_Text_IvyPostBattle:
	.string "艾薇：我开始训练宝可梦，\n"
	.string "是因为泰拉学姐教了我！$"

Route114_Text_IvyNotEnoughMons:
	.string "艾薇：你只有一只宝可梦？\n"
	.string "我觉得它一定很孤单。$"

Route114_Text_KaiIntro:
	.string "我钓到大家伙了！\n"
	.string "真的是超大的一条！$"

Route114_Text_KaiDefeat:
	.string "怎么回事？\n"
	.string "我的比不过大小吗？$"

Route114_Text_KaiPostBattle:
	.string "好！\n"
	.string "那我就去钓一条更大的！$"

Route114_Text_CharlotteIntro:
	.string "我！\n"
	.string "我可不只是长得可爱！$"

Route114_Text_CharlotteDefeat:
	.string "一点也不可爱！$"

Route114_Text_CharlottePostBattle:
	.string "我不想要只是可爱的宝可梦。\p"
	.string "我喜欢有点小怪癖的\n"
	.string "可爱宝可梦！$"

Route114_Text_AngelinaIntro:
	.string "你让宝可梦进化了\n"
	.string "很多次吗？$"

Route114_Text_AngelinaDefeat:
	.string "哦，原来如此。\n"
	.string "这倒是值得了解。$"

Route114_Text_AngelinaPostBattle:
	.string "有些宝可梦进化后变化\n"
	.string "大得惊人！$"

Route115_Text_TimothyIntro:
	.string "嗯……\n"
	.string "你似乎挺有一手……\l"
	.string "让我来陪你练练！$"

Route115_Text_TimothyDefeat:
	.string "你比我想象的\n"
	.string "强多了！$"

Route115_Text_TimothyPostBattle:
	.string "没有天生的天才。\n"
	.string "一切全靠努力！\l"
	.string "我如此相信……$"

Route115_Text_TimothyRegister:
	.string "嗯……输得这么彻底\n"
	.string "已经很久没有过了。\p"
	.string "如果允许的话，\n"
	.string "我希望再有一次对战的机会。$"

Route115_Text_TimothyRematchIntro:
	.string "嗯……你的身手\n"
	.string "还是那么敏捷。\l"
	.string "来吧，陪练一下！$"

Route115_Text_TimothyRematchDefeat:
	.string "还是那么强！$"

Route115_Text_TimothyPostRematch:
	.string "一切都靠努力！\p"
	.string "我输了，是因为努力\n"
	.string "还不够！$"

Route115_Text_KoichiIntro:
	.string "你！\p"
	.string "我的腕力！\p"
	.string "要求对战！$"

Route115_Text_KoichiDefeat:
	.string "哎哟、哎哟、哎哟！$"

Route115_Text_KoichiPostBattle:
	.string "我的腕力兄弟们！\p"
	.string "只要它们追求力量，\n"
	.string "我就会和它们一起变强！$"

Route115_Text_NobIntro:
	.string "我最擅长的就是用\n"
	.string "额头劈砖！$"

Route115_Text_NobDefeat:
	.string "呜哇啊！\n"
	.string "我的头裂了！$"

Route115_Text_NobPostBattle:
	.string "我一直在教宝可梦空手道。\p"
	.string "看来它们会变得比我\n"
	.string "厉害得多。真期待。$"

Route115_Text_NobRegister:
	.string "你让我佩服！\n"
	.string "等我重新训练完再打一场！$"

Route115_Text_NobRematchIntro:
	.string "你打败我之后，我们\n"
	.string "刻苦训练提高技巧。\l"
	.string "来吧，再打一场！$"

Route115_Text_NobRematchDefeat:
	.string "呜哇啊！\n"
	.string "我们又输了！$"

Route115_Text_NobPostRematch:
	.string "我的宝可梦会变得更强！\n"
	.string "我要加倍训练！$"

Route115_Text_CyndyIntro:
	.string "这片沙滩是我的秘密训练场！\n"
	.string "别来打扰！$"

Route115_Text_CyndyDefeat:
	.string "我训练得还不够！$"

Route115_Text_CyndyPostBattle:
	.string "沙子能缓冲冲击，\n"
	.string "防止受伤。\l"
	.string "这里最适合训练了。$"

Route115_Text_CyndyRegister:
	.string "好吧，你可以来。\n"
	.string "作为交换，再打一场吧。$"

Route115_Text_CyndyRematchIntro:
	.string "好，开始对战吧！$"

Route115_Text_CyndyRematchDefeat:
	.string "我能打，但我的宝可梦……$"

Route115_Text_CyndyPostRematch:
	.string "就算输了，我也还是\n"
	.string "觉得挺开心。\l"
	.string "这一定是因为我爱宝可梦。$"

Route115_Text_HectorIntro:
	.string "我有稀有的宝可梦！\n"
	.string "要我给你看看吗？$"

Route115_Text_HectorDefeat:
	.string "你……\n"
	.string "你想要我的宝可梦，对吧？$"

Route115_Text_HectorPostBattle:
	.string "我有这只稀有的宝可梦。\n"
	.string "这就够让我满足了。$"

Route115_Text_KyraIntro:
	.string "我边跑边对战！\n"
	.string "跟上我试试！$"

Route115_Text_KyraDefeat:
	.string "呼、呼……$"

Route115_Text_KyraPostBattle:
	.string "我犯了个错，边跑边对战！\p"
	.string "我该跑一跑冷静下来……$"

Route115_Text_JaidenIntro:
	.string "接招！\n"
	.string "究极宝可梦忍者攻击！$"

Route115_Text_JaidenDefeat:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "我们的战术失败了！$"

Route115_Text_JaidenPostBattle:
	.string "不过我的宝可梦很究极吧？$"

Route115_Text_HeleneIntro:
	.string "我的宝可梦有黑带级的\n"
	.string "实力！$"

Route115_Text_HeleneDefeat:
	.string "太丢脸了！$"

Route115_Text_HelenePostBattle:
	.string "很少有人比我强……\p"
	.string "我明白了！\n"
	.string "你是道馆馆主，对吧？$"

Route115_Text_AlixIntro:
	.string "我们目光相遇了！\n"
	.string "现在可跑不掉了！$"

Route115_Text_AlixDefeat:
	.string "呜！\n"
	.string "不错嘛！$"

Route115_Text_AlixPostBattle:
	.string "算了。\n"
	.string "我想我该瞬间移动回家了。$"

Route115_Text_MarleneIntro:
	.string "你打扰了我的冥想……\n"
	.string "你要为此受罚。$"

Route115_Text_MarleneDefeat:
	.string "你打乱了我的专注！$"

Route115_Text_MarlenePostBattle:
	.string "我刚和宝可梦一起冥想。\n"
	.string "不过这里不太安静……$"

Route116_Text_ClarkIntro:
	.string "如果隧道通不过，\n"
	.string "我就翻过山顶。$"

Route116_Text_ClarkDefeat:
	.string "呼……呼……\n"
	.string "输了让我好累……$"

Route116_Text_ClarkPostBattle:
	.string "没有隧道也没什么。\n"
	.string "对登山男来说，山就是路！$"

Route116_Text_JoeyIntro:
	.string "我的宝可梦最强！\n"
	.string "来看看！$"

Route116_Text_JoeyDefeat:
	.string "哎哟！擦伤了！\n"
	.string "我得贴上创可贴！$"

Route116_Text_JoeyPostBattle:
	.string "创可贴是坚强的证明！\n"
	.string "我又多了一个！$"

Route116_Text_JoseIntro:
	.string "我的虫宝可梦很强！\n"
	.string "来对战吧！$"

Route116_Text_JoseDefeat:
	.string "我输了！\n"
	.string "我还以为能赢！$"

Route116_Text_JosePostBattle:
	.string "虫宝可梦进化很快。\n"
	.string "所以也很快变强。$"

Route116_Text_JaniceIntro:
	.string "让我教教你我的可爱宝可梦\n"
	.string "有多强！$"

Route116_Text_JaniceDefeat:
	.string "你比我高一个档次……$"

Route116_Text_JanicePostBattle:
	.string "既可爱又有实力的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我觉得那才理想。$"

Route116_Text_JerryIntro:
	.string "我们在训练家学校\n"
	.string "学习各种东西。\p"
	.string "我想实际试试看！$"

Route116_Text_JerryDefeat:
	.string "我在学校偷懒了……\n"
	.string "所以我输了。$"

Route116_Text_JerryPostBattle:
	.string "我得去训练家学校\n"
	.string "重修几门课。\l"
	.string "不然杜鹃会发火的。$"

Route116_Text_JerryRegister1:
	.string "我在训练家学校学过，\n"
	.string "导航能登记训练家。\p"
	.string "我不太懂那是什么意思，\n"
	.string "能让我试试吗？$"

Route116_Text_JerryRegister2:
	.string "我在训练家学校学过，\n"
	.string "导航能登记训练家。\p"
	.string "我不太懂那是什么意思，\n"
	.string "能让我试试吗？$"

Route116_Text_JerryRematchIntro:
	.string "我在训练家学校\n"
	.string "认真学习过了。\l"
	.string "不会再像上次那样输。$"

Route116_Text_JerryRematchDefeat:
	.string "咦？\n"
	.string "我明明认真学了啊。$"

Route116_Text_JerryPostRematch:
	.string "我得去训练家学校\n"
	.string "重修几门课。\l"
	.string "不然杜鹃会发火的。$"

Route116_Text_KarenIntro:
	.string "我在学校学习，\n"
	.string "放学路上也在学习！$"

Route116_Text_KarenDefeat:
	.string "我震惊了——我输了？$"

Route116_Text_KarenPostBattle:
	.string "呜呜，这样我永远也成不了\n"
	.string "杜鹃那样优雅的训练家！$"

Route116_Text_KarenRegister1:
	.string "哇！那不是导航吗？\n"
	.string "我也有！请登记我！$"

Route116_Text_KarenRegister2:
	.string "哇！那不是导航吗？\n"
	.string "我也有！请登记我！$"

Route116_Text_KarenRematchIntro:
	.string "上次见你之后我学了好多。\n"
	.string "你一定要看看我的成果！$"

Route116_Text_KarenRematchDefeat:
	.string "我震惊了。\n"
	.string "我又输了？$"

Route116_Text_KarenPostRematch:
	.string "你打赢杜鹃了？\n"
	.string "那我现在还赢不了你。$"

Route116_Text_SarahIntro:
	.string "先跟你说清楚，我从来\n"
	.string "没在任何事上输过。$"

Route116_Text_SarahDefeat:
	.string "哦，天哪。\n"
	.string "这对我来说是新体验。$"

Route116_Text_SarahPostBattle:
	.string "我富裕的生活让我\n"
	.string "想要什么都有。\p"
	.string "不过在宝可梦方面，\n"
	.string "我的财富毫无意义。$"

Route116_Text_DawsonIntro:
	.string "等你看到我宝可梦那华丽的\n"
	.string "毛发，它们的美丽会让你\l"
	.string "动弹不得！$"

Route116_Text_DawsonDefeat:
	.string "哦，天啊，这不是真的！$"

Route116_Text_DawsonPostBattle:
	.string "哦，不不不！\n"
	.string "你把我的宝可梦的毛弄乱了！\l"
	.string "我的发型也毁了！\l"
	.string "我得马上叫造型师！$"

Route116_Text_DevanIntro:
	.string "我们要把你震翻！$"

Route116_Text_DevanDefeat:
	.string "哎呀呀！\n"
	.string "完全打不过！$"

Route116_Text_DevanPostBattle:
	.string "我该试试其他属性的\n"
	.string "宝可梦，对，应该这样。$"

Route116_Text_JohnsonIntro:
	.string "这上面是死路。\n"
	.string "我好无聊，能打一场吗？$"

Route116_Text_JohnsonDefeat:
	.string "虽然输了，但真有意思。$"

Route116_Text_JohnsonPostBattle:
	.string "要留在这里陪陪我吗？$"

Route117_Text_EzekielIntro:
	.string "听我说，能和我培养的\n"
	.string "宝可梦对战吗？$"

Route117_Text_EzekielDefeat:
	.string "你把宝可梦培养得真好……$"

Route117_Text_EzekielPostBattle:
	.string "宝可梦不只是力量。\p"
	.string "打磨宝可梦独特的个性，\n"
	.string "也是享受宝可梦的一种方式。$"

Route117_Text_EzekielRegister:
	.string "我要加倍训练。\n"
	.string "你能来看看我们吗？$"

Route117_Text_EzekielRematchIntro:
	.string "我培养的宝可梦\n"
	.string "还是和以前一样棒。$"

Route117_Text_EzekielRematchDefeat:
	.string "你懂得怎么好好培养。\n"
	.string "你也许有培育屋的才能……$"

Route117_Text_EzekielPostRematch:
	.string "你的宝可梦长得真好！\n"
	.string "该让它们去参加华丽大赛。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaIntro:
	.string "请让我评估一下，你是否有\n"
	.string "好好培养宝可梦。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaDefeat:
	.string "是的，它们成长得很好。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaPostBattle:
	.string "培养宝可梦时，试试更\n"
	.string "关注它们的个性特征。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaRegister:
	.string "很高兴遇到你这么出色的\n"
	.string "训练家。希望还能再见。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaRematchIntro:
	.string "让我再评估一次，你是否有\n"
	.string "好好培养宝可梦。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaRematchDefeat:
	.string "它们成长得令人赞叹。$"

Route117_Text_LydiaPostRematch:
	.string "宝可梦会依性格喜欢\n"
	.string "不同种类的宝可方块。$"

Route117_Text_DylanIntro:
	.string "我正在铁人三项中，不过\n"
	.string "算了，来打一场吧！$"

Route117_Text_DylanDefeat:
	.string "我没力气了！$"

Route117_Text_DylanPostBattle:
	.string "我可能搞砸了……\p"
	.string "刚才那场对战，我大概\n"
	.string "掉到最后一名了……$"

Route117_Text_DylanRegister:
	.string "宝可梦也得变强才行？\n"
	.string "希望你来训练我！$"

Route117_Text_DylanRematchIntro:
	.string "我正处在铁人三项中间，\n"
	.string "不过领先得很轻松。\l"
	.string "快点打完吧！$"

Route117_Text_DylanRematchDefeat:
	.string "我又没力气了！$"

Route117_Text_DylanPostRematch:
	.string "游泳和自行车我都是第一，\n"
	.string "但对宝可梦还没那么自信。$"

Route117_Text_MariaIntro:
	.string "我和宝可梦一起做铁人三项\n"
	.string "训练，所以对速度很有自信。$"

Route117_Text_MariaDefeat:
	.string "看来我得多练练。$"

Route117_Text_MariaPostBattle:
	.string "训练只有坚持才有意义。\p"
	.string "好！我要恢复训练！\n"
	.string "明天开始！$"

Route117_Text_MariaRegister:
	.string "你看起来训练得不错……\n"
	.string "如果可以，待会儿打一场吧！$"

Route117_Text_MariaRematchIntro:
	.string "你还在坚持训练吗？\n"
	.string "我可是在坚持！\l"
	.string "给你看看成果！$"

Route117_Text_MariaRematchDefeat:
	.string "看来我得多练练。$"

Route117_Text_MariaPostRematch:
	.string "我明天开始恢复训练。\n"
	.string "下次再对战吧！$"

Route117_Text_DerekIntro:
	.string "我曾经是捕虫少年！\n"
	.string "现在是昆虫狂！\p"
	.string "但我对宝可梦的爱\n"
	.string "从未改变！$"

Route117_Text_DerekDefeat:
	.string "我的没长进也\n"
	.string "从未改变……$"

Route117_Text_DerekPostBattle:
	.string "我只是随心而行，现在\n"
	.string "大家却叫我昆虫狂……\p"
	.string "不过我确实是虫宝可梦专家，\n"
	.string "被叫作昆虫狂也很自然。$"

Route117_Text_AnnaIntro:
	.string "安娜：我和可爱的学妹\n"
	.string "搭档在一起，必须加油！$"

Route117_Text_AnnaDefeat:
	.string "安娜：我和可爱的学妹\n"
	.string "搭档！让我赢啊！$"

Route117_Text_AnnaPostBattle:
	.string "安娜：你的宝可梦\n"
	.string "组合不错。\p"
	.string "我看你只比我们差一点！$"

Route117_Text_AnnaAndMegRegister:
	.string "安娜：我们可不会认输！\n"
	.string "你还会再来的吧？$"

Route117_Text_AnnaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "安娜：想和我们打的话，\n"
	.string "带两只宝可梦来。$"

Route117_Text_MegIntro:
	.string "梅格：我要和超厉害的学姐\n"
	.string "搭档，把你打倒！$"

Route117_Text_MegDefeat:
	.string "梅格：哦，不！\n"
	.string "对不起，安娜！\l"
	.string "我让你失望了……$"

Route117_Text_MegPostBattle:
	.string "梅格：我拖累了安娜……\n"
	.string "不然她就能赢！$"

Route117_Text_MegNotEnoughMons:
	.string "梅格：你只有一只宝可梦？\n"
	.string "那我们没法和你打。\p"
	.string "我们想二对二对战。$"

Route117_Text_AnnaRematchIntro:
	.string "安娜：我总不能一直在\n"
	.string "学妹面前输吧？$"

Route117_Text_AnnaRematchDefeat:
	.string "安娜：我没找到状态。$"

Route117_Text_AnnaPostRematch:
	.string "安娜：你的宝可梦\n"
	.string "组合不错。\p"
	.string "我看你只比我们差一点！$"

Route117_Text_AnnaRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "安娜：想和我们打的话，\n"
	.string "带两只宝可梦来。$"

Route117_Text_MegRematchIntro:
	.string "梅格：这次我要和学姐\n"
	.string "搭档，赢下来！$"

Route117_Text_MegRematchDefeat:
	.string "梅格：太强了！$"

Route117_Text_MegPostRematch:
	.string "梅格：我和学姐一起对战，\n"
	.string "却输了……\p"
	.string "太让人泄气了……$"

Route117_Text_MegRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "梅格：你只有一只宝可梦？\n"
	.string "那我们没法和你打。\p"
	.string "我们想二对二对战。$"

Route117_Text_MelinaIntro:
	.string "一边看着美丽的花，\n"
	.string "一边对战，是不是很棒？$"

Route117_Text_MelinaDefeat:
	.string "哦，真是了不起！$"

Route117_Text_MelinaPostBattle:
	.string "一边看花一边慢跑，\n"
	.string "感觉真好。$"

Route117_Text_BrandiIntro:
	.string "让我展示超能宝可梦\n"
	.string "隐藏的力量！$"

Route117_Text_BrandiDefeat:
	.string "惊人！$"

Route117_Text_BrandiPostBattle:
	.string "超能宝可梦很复杂。\n"
	.string "你该抓几只试试。$"

Route117_Text_AishaIntro:
	.string "专心争取胜利。\n"
	.string "我就是这样对战的！$"

Route117_Text_AishaDefeat:
	.string "我不会浪费时间\n"
	.string "为输而生气——不如去训练。$"

Route117_Text_AishaPostBattle:
	.string "我觉得越担心输，\n"
	.string "就越容易输。$"

Route118_Text_RoseIntro:
	.string "花香有神奇的力量。\n"
	.string "它能净化我们的身心。$"

Route118_Text_RoseDefeat:
	.string "哦，天哪。\n"
	.string "我好像输了。$"

Route118_Text_RosePostBattle:
	.string "花、宝可梦……\n"
	.string "我喜欢一切好闻的东西。\p"
	.string "臭的东西……\n"
	.string "还是算了。$"

Route118_Text_RoseRegister:
	.string "嗅嗅……这气味——是导航！\n"
	.string "我们必须互相登记！$"

Route118_Text_RoseRematchIntro:
	.string "你也被甜香\n"
	.string "引来的吗？$"

Route118_Text_RoseRematchDefeat:
	.string "香气之力……\n"
	.string "好像没起什么作用。$"

Route118_Text_RosePostRematch:
	.string "如果好好使用甜香，\n"
	.string "宝可梦就会被吸引过来。$"

Route118_Text_PerryIntro:
	.string "在天空中优雅飞翔的\n"
	.string "鸟宝可梦……最棒了！$"

Route118_Text_PerryDefeat:
	.string "唔……\n"
	.string "我坠机了……$"

Route118_Text_PerryPostBattle:
	.string "你的宝可梦很棒。\n"
	.string "我得把我的训练得更好。$"

Route118_Text_ChesterIntro:
	.string "起飞吧！\n"
	.string "我的鸟宝可梦！$"

Route118_Text_ChesterDefeat:
	.string "它们确实起飞了……$"

Route118_Text_ChesterPostBattle:
	.string "要是它们变强，\n"
	.string "就能飞得更自在了……$"

Route118_Text_BarnyIntro:
	.string "我是钓客，也是训练家。\n"
	.string "我在培养钓到的宝可梦。$"

Route118_Text_BarnyDefeat:
	.string "我还以为自己\n"
	.string "训练得不错……$"

Route118_Text_BarnyPostBattle:
	.string "我一边钓鱼一边训练宝可梦，\n"
	.string "却赢不了……\p"
	.string "是不是我做事都只有半吊子？$"

Route118_Text_WadeIntro:
	.string "对钓客来说，装备是关键。\p"
	.string "但对训练家来说，关键\n"
	.string "当然是宝可梦和心！$"

Route118_Text_WadeDefeat:
	.string "我在心上输了？$"

Route118_Text_WadePostBattle:
	.string "说起来，钓鱼就是钓客\n"
	.string "和宝可梦之间的对战。$"

Route118_Text_DaltonIntro:
	.string "让我的旋律震撼你的灵魂！$"

Route118_Text_DaltonDefeat:
	.string "啦——啦啦啦……$"

Route118_Text_DaltonPostBattle:
	.string "电吉他并不一定\n"
	.string "总是吵闹……\p"
	.string "轻轻拨弦也能奏出\n"
	.string "这样动人的旋律……$"

Route118_Text_DaltonRegister:
	.string "等我写出更好的旋律，\n"
	.string "你一定要来听，好吗？$"

Route118_Text_DaltonRematchIntro:
	.string "我和宝可梦的旋律……\n"
	.string "让我们把它送到你的灵魂。$"

Route118_Text_DaltonRematchDefeat:
	.string "啦——啦啦啦……$"

Route118_Text_DaltonPostRematch:
	.string "我弹奏时，感情应该会\n"
	.string "通过电吉他传给你……$"

Route118_Text_DeandreIntro:
	.string "去吧、去吧、去吧！\n"
	.string "宝可梦1号、2号和3号！$"

Route118_Text_DeandreDefeat:
	.string "回来，宝可梦！你们没事吧？\n"
	.string "1号、2号和3号？！$"

Route118_Text_DeandrePostBattle:
	.string "我有一支宝可梦对战队伍，\n"
	.string "很酷吧？\p"
	.string "你可以学我——我不介意！$"

Route119_Text_BrentIntro:
	.string "我们是模仿圈！\n"
	.string "你做什么我们就模仿什么！$"

Route119_Text_BrentDefeat:
	.string "哎呀！\n"
	.string "我输了！$"

Route119_Text_BrentPostBattle:
	.string "模仿有什么好的？\p"
	.string "呵呵……\n"
	.string "你永远不会懂……$"

Route119_Text_DonaldIntro:
	.string "我们终于见面了！\n"
	.string "我的虫宝可梦会陪你玩！$"

Route119_Text_DonaldDefeat:
	.string "真希望我们从没见面……$"

Route119_Text_DonaldPostBattle:
	.string "我还想再模仿你。\n"
	.string "你能快点动吗？$"

Route119_Text_TaylorIntro:
	.string "你往前走，我们也往前走。\p"
	.string "你向右转，我们也转……$"

Route119_Text_TaylorDefeat:
	.string "可你赢，我就输了……$"

Route119_Text_TaylorPostBattle:
	.string "我没法模仿你赢下比赛。\n"
	.string "那根本不可能……\l"
	.string "真让我火大……$"

Route119_Text_DougIntro:
	.string "对，你终于抓到我了！\n"
	.string "还是你一直在躲我？$"

Route119_Text_DougDefeat:
	.string "哇，真是场好对战！$"

Route119_Text_DougPostBattle:
	.string "我们是模仿圈！\n"
	.string "希望你喜欢我们的表演。$"

Route119_Text_GregIntro:
	.string "你不知道我是谁，对吧？\p"
	.string "可我也不知道你。\n"
	.string "那就对战吧！$"

Route119_Text_GregDefeat:
	.string "你挺强的！$"

Route119_Text_GregPostBattle:
	.string "在你离开之前，我们会\n"
	.string "一直模仿你的一举一动。$"

Route119_Text_KentIntro:
	.string "模仿圈是喜欢模仿的\n"
	.string "人组成的。\p"
	.string "我们一见面就开始对战！$"

Route119_Text_KentDefeat:
	.string "我认输！$"

Route119_Text_KentPostBattle:
	.string "要不要加入我们的模仿圈？$"

Route119_Text_JacksonIntro:
	.string "谁拥有生存所需的\n"
	.string "知识和技巧？\p"
	.string "当然是巡护员！$"

Route119_Text_JacksonDefeat:
	.string "我的宝可梦知识\n"
	.string "还不够……$"

Route119_Text_JacksonPostBattle:
	.string "脱离文明，唤醒心中\n"
	.string "的野性！\p"
	.string "这就是我们的理想。$"

Route119_Text_JacksonRegister:
	.string "希望下次再战时，\n"
	.string "你别嘲笑我知识不足。$"

Route119_Text_JacksonRematchIntro:
	.string "我要和宝可梦在一起，\n"
	.string "找回我的野性。$"

Route119_Text_JacksonRematchDefeat:
	.string "你还是那么强！$"

Route119_Text_JacksonPostRematch:
	.string "相信你的宝可梦。\n"
	.string "相信你自己。\p"
	.string "道路自然会显现出来。$"

Route119_Text_CatherineIntro:
	.string "哦？看看你。\p"
	.string "作为在旅途上的人，\n"
	.string "你带的行李真轻啊。$"

Route119_Text_CatherineDefeat:
	.string "没准备好就会出事！$"

Route119_Text_CatherinePostBattle:
	.string "你行李很轻，但该有的\n"
	.string "东西都有。\p"
	.string "身心两方面你都很在行。$"

Route119_Text_CatherineRegister:
	.string "你有导航吗？\n"
	.string "那是训练家必备的工具。\p"
	.string "哦，你还真有！\n"
	.string "那让我们互相登记吧！$"

Route119_Text_CatherineRematchIntro:
	.string "和宝可梦的旅程\n"
	.string "进行得怎么样？$"

Route119_Text_CatherineRematchDefeat:
	.string "我还缺点什么……$"

Route119_Text_CatherinePostRematch:
	.string "就像训练家依靠宝可梦，\n"
	.string "宝可梦也依靠着你。$"

Route119_Text_HughIntro:
	.string "辽阔的天空充满未知的可能！\p"
	.string "没有什么比飞翔的兴奋\n"
	.string "更让人激动！$"

Route119_Text_HughDefeat:
	.string "彻底败了！$"

Route119_Text_HughPostBattle:
	.string "我的鸟宝可梦让我\n"
	.string "飞翔的梦想成真了！$"

Route119_Text_PhilIntro:
	.string "让你见识我和鸟宝可梦\n"
	.string "的真正潜力！$"

Route119_Text_PhilDefeat:
	.string "我们缺乏潜力……$"

Route119_Text_PhilPostBattle:
	.string "从小时候起，我就一直\n"
	.string "仰慕鸟宝可梦……$"

Route119_Text_YasuIntro:
	.string "潜伏于影，生于黑暗……\n"
	.string "这就是我的宿命。\p"
	.string "我现身来挑战你！$"

Route119_Text_YasuDefeat:
	.string "我认输！$"

Route119_Text_YasuPostBattle:
	.string "在对战中落败的人，\n"
	.string "会静静退回黑暗。\l"
	.string "这也是宿命……$"

Route119_Text_TakashiIntro:
	.string "疏于防备的话，\n"
	.string "可要吃苦头！$"

Route119_Text_TakashiDefeat:
	.string "你出人意料地强！$"

Route119_Text_TakashiPostBattle:
	.string "我的偷袭失败了……$"

Route119_Text_HideoIntro:
	.string "藏一棵树，用一片森林！$"

Route119_Text_HideoDefeat:
	.string "我甘拜下风。$"

Route119_Text_HideoPostBattle:
	.string "藏一棵树，用一片森林！\n"
	.string "藏一只宝可梦，用宝可梦！\p"
	.string "这没什么深意。$"

Route119_Text_ChrisIntro:
	.string "你和我说话了……\n"
	.string "那你是要挑战我！\p"
	.string "好！我用冲浪时抓到的\n"
	.string "宝可梦试试！$"

Route119_Text_ChrisDefeat:
	.string "我完全不知道该怎么做\n"
	.string "才能赢。$"

Route119_Text_ChrisPostBattle:
	.string "骑着宝可梦去冲浪……\p"
	.string "然后在水面上钓鱼……\p"
	.string "真是说不出的奢侈时光！$"

Route119_Text_FabianIntro:
	.string "来一记强力和弦！\n"
	.string "胜利属于我！\l"
	.string "轮到我们发光了，哇哦！$"

Route119_Text_FabianDefeat:
	.string "你让我知道了谁才是老大！\n"
	.string "这败仗我们认了，哦不！$"

Route119_Text_FabianPostBattle:
	.string "再来一记强力和弦！\n"
	.string "别烦我！\l"
	.string "你的胜利得你自己赎！$"

Route119_Text_DaytonIntro:
	.string "呵呵呵！\n"
	.string "我喜欢小孩训练家！\l"
	.string "来好好打一场！$"

Route119_Text_DaytonDefeat:
	.string "你真是了不起！\n"
	.string "呵呵呵！$"

Route119_Text_DaytonPostBattle:
	.string "呵呵呵！\n"
	.string "我也要学学你们小孩训练家的\l"
	.string "活力！$"

Route119_Text_RaquelIntro:
	.string "无论何时何地，我手上\n"
	.string "总是带着阳伞。$"

Route119_Text_RaquelDefeat:
	.string "哦，可是……\n"
	.string "这不公平。$"

Route119_Text_RaquelPostBattle:
	.string "你问我阳伞重不重？\n"
	.string "你那背包里的杂物可比\l"
	.string "我带的还多。$"

Route120_Text_ColinIntro:
	.string "你有能打到飞行\n"
	.string "宝可梦的招式吗？$"

Route120_Text_ColinDefeat:
	.string "你飞越了我！$"

Route120_Text_ColinPostBattle:
	.string "飞翔这个招式很方便，\n"
	.string "你不觉得吗？\p"
	.string "宝可梦在飞翔时，\n"
	.string "几乎没有招式能打到它。$"

Route120_Text_RobertIntro:
	.string "我的宝可梦很强！\n"
	.string "你的呢？$"

Route120_Text_RobertDefeat:
	.string "你的宝可梦更强……$"

Route120_Text_RobertPostBattle:
	.string "稳定成长的宝可梦\n"
	.string "是值得信赖的。$"

Route120_Text_RobertRegister:
	.string "你一定还会变强。\n"
	.string "我想把你登记进导航！$"

Route120_Text_RobertRematchIntro:
	.string "稳定成长的宝可梦\n"
	.string "是值得信赖的。$"

Route120_Text_RobertRematchDefeat:
	.string "你的宝可梦真的很强。$"

Route120_Text_RobertPostRematch:
	.string "我的宝可梦在变强。\n"
	.string "我也得变强才行。$"

Route120_Text_LorenzoIntro:
	.string "我来检查你的宝可梦\n"
	.string "能不能适应野外。$"

Route120_Text_LorenzoDefeat:
	.string "有这么强的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "你根本不需要救援！$"

Route120_Text_LorenzoPostBattle:
	.string "带着宝可梦去任何\n"
	.string "心之所向的地方……\l"
	.string "这就是训练家的快乐。$"

Route120_Text_JennaIntro:
	.string "你的体力怎么样？\n"
	.string "体力不好的话，遇到危急关头\l"
	.string "可就难办了。$"

Route120_Text_JennaDefeat:
	.string "我体力完全没问题，可是……$"

Route120_Text_JennaPostBattle:
	.string "体能训练是我的日常。\n"
	.string "我总是和宝可梦一起跑。$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyIntro:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "………………\l"
	.string "要对战吗？$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyDefeat:
	.string "没门……$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyPostBattle:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "………………\l"
	.string "我会更努力的……$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyRegister:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "………………\l"
	.string "你有导航吗……？$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyRematchIntro:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "………………\l"
	.string "要再对战一次吗？$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyRematchDefeat:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "我又输了……$"

Route120_Text_JeffreyPostRematch:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "………………\l"
	.string "我会更努力的……\l"
	.string "为了我珍贵的虫宝可梦……$"

Route120_Text_JenniferIntro:
	.string "宝可梦有很多特殊能力。\n"
	.string "想成为一流训练家，\l"
	.string "就得多了解它们。$"

Route120_Text_JenniferDefeat:
	.string "你显然在思考。$"

Route120_Text_JenniferPostBattle:
	.string "宝可梦的特殊能力\n"
	.string "会让对战风格改变。$"

Route120_Text_ChipIntro:
	.string "你是谁？\p"
	.string "你该不会是在找传说中\n"
	.string "可能存在的古代遗迹吧？$"

Route120_Text_ChipDefeat:
	.string "真是丢脸的挫折……$"

Route120_Text_ChipPostBattle:
	.string "那块巨石……我愿意相信\n"
	.string "里面真的藏着古代遗迹。$"

Route120_Text_ClarissaIntro:
	.string "我为什么带着阳伞？\p"
	.string "你要是能赢我，我就告诉你。$"

Route120_Text_ClarissaDefeat:
	.string "阳伞挡不住宝可梦的攻击……$"

Route120_Text_ClarissaPostBattle:
	.string "我觉得强烈的阳光对\n"
	.string "宝可梦不好。\l"
	.string "所以我用阳伞替它们遮阳。$"

Route120_Text_AngelicaIntro:
	.string "我、宝可梦和阳伞……\p"
	.string "缺少任何一样，\n"
	.string "美丽的画面就会被破坏。$"

Route120_Text_AngelicaDefeat:
	.string "你完全破坏了\n"
	.string "我的美丽……$"

Route120_Text_AngelicaPostBattle:
	.string "阳伞一点也不适合你。\p"
	.string "这种东西只会碍你的事。$"

Route120_Text_KeigoIntro:
	.string "我要借鉴宝可梦的动作，\n"
	.string "创造新的忍术。$"

Route120_Text_KeigoDefeat:
	.string "创造新忍术还只是\n"
	.string "遥远的梦想……$"

Route120_Text_KeigoPostBattle:
	.string "也许我该去拜个\n"
	.string "忍者师傅。$"

Route120_Text_RileyIntro:
	.string "我们忍者靠迷彩披风\n"
	.string "隐藏自己。\l"
	.string "你肯定不知道我在哪！$"

Route120_Text_RileyDefeat:
	.string "我输了！\n"
	.string "我该用迷彩遮住这份羞耻！$"

Route120_Text_RileyPostBattle:
	.string "我们的迷彩披风\n"
	.string "全是手工做的。$"

Route120_Text_CallieIntro:
	.string "不注意的话，\n"
	.string "可是会受伤的！$"

Route120_Text_CallieDefeat:
	.string "哎哟！\n"
	.string "受伤的是我。$"

Route120_Text_CalliePostBattle:
	.string "我在想……要不要让我的\n"
	.string "宝可梦进化？\l"
	.string "不过它们现在这样也很可爱。$"

Route120_Text_LeonelIntro:
	.string "你的队伍宝可梦……\n"
	.string "属性都不一样吗？$"

Route120_Text_LeonelDefeat:
	.string "我见识到你的做法了！$"

Route120_Text_LeonelPostBattle:
	.string "用自己最喜欢的宝可梦\n"
	.string "还能这么强，真了不起。$"

Route121_Text_VanessaIntro:
	.string "要和我漂亮可爱的\n"
	.string "宝可梦玩玩吗？$"

Route121_Text_VanessaDefeat:
	.string "我不是这个意思！$"

Route121_Text_VanessaPostBattle:
