	.string "我的宝可梦应该能横扫\n"
	.string "大师组。$"

Route121_Text_WalterIntro:
	.string "我和宝可梦一起走遍了\n"
	.string "世界的四个角落。\p"
	.string "可以说我对自己的\n"
	.string "实力有点自信。$"

Route121_Text_WalterDefeat:
	.string "啊，打得好。$"

Route121_Text_WalterPostBattle:
	.string "我想再和宝可梦\n"
	.string "环游世界一次。$"

Route121_Text_WalterRegister:
	.string "你的宝可梦实力很出色。\n"
	.string "让我把你登记下来作纪念。$"

Route121_Text_WalterRematchIntro:
	.string "我和宝可梦一起走遍了\n"
	.string "世界的四个角落。\p"
	.string "可以说我对自己的\n"
	.string "实力有点自信。$"

Route121_Text_WalterRematchDefeat:
	.string "啊，打得好。$"

Route121_Text_WalterPostRematch:
	.string "你和你的宝可梦……\p"
	.string "你们的实力在国外\n"
	.string "也算得上强大。$"

Route121_Text_TammyIntro:
	.string "这世上还有我们无法\n"
	.string "理解的力量……$"

Route121_Text_TammyDefeat:
	.string "我输了……$"

Route121_Text_TammyPostBattle:
	.string "送神山……\n"
	.string "那里有神秘的力量\l"
	.string "在起作用……$"

Route121_Text_KateIntro:
	.string "凯特：我们在一起就无敌！\n"
	.string "让你看看我们有多强！$"

Route121_Text_KateDefeat:
	.string "凯特：我在学妹面前\n"
	.string "出丑了……$"

Route121_Text_KatePostBattle:
	.string "凯特：有人依靠我时，\n"
	.string "我就想在他们面前\l"
	.string "表现得帅气一点……$"

Route121_Text_KateNotEnoughMons:
	.string "凯特：你只有一只宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我们没法和你打。\p"
	.string "那算是欺负人了。$"

Route121_Text_JoyIntro:
	.string "乔依：我们在一起就无所畏惧！\n"
	.string "让你看看我们有多强！$"

Route121_Text_JoyDefeat:
	.string "乔依：请原谅我，凯特！$"

Route121_Text_JoyPostBattle:
	.string "乔依：嘿嘿，我得再和学姐\n"
	.string "凯特一起训练了。$"

Route121_Text_JoyNotEnoughMons:
	.string "乔依：想挑战我们，\n"
	.string "至少得带两只宝可梦！$"

Route121_Text_JessicaIntro:
	.string "站住！好好看看我珍贵的\n"
	.string "宝可梦！$"

Route121_Text_JessicaDefeat:
	.string "哦，你太无礼了！\n"
	.string "别这么认真嘛！$"

Route121_Text_JessicaPostBattle:
	.string "也许我该去狩猎区\n"
	.string "再抓些宝可梦。$"

Route121_Text_JessicaRegister:
	.string "这次我手下留情了！\n"
	.string "下次可不会这样！$"

Route121_Text_JessicaRematchIntro:
	.string "我珍贵的宝可梦长大了！\n"
	.string "好好看看！$"

Route121_Text_JessicaRematchDefeat:
	.string "哦，你太无礼了！\n"
	.string "你还是不留情！$"

Route121_Text_JessicaPostRematch:
	.string "也许我该去狩猎区\n"
	.string "再抓些宝可梦。$"

Route121_Text_CristinIntro:
	.string "我有个习惯。\n"
	.string "一天打倒五个训练家。\l"
	.string "猜怎么着？你是第五个！$"

Route121_Text_CristinDefeat:
	.string "不！\n"
	.string "你真讨厌！$"

Route121_Text_CristinPostBattle:
	.string "没想到会这么轻易输掉……\n"
	.string "下次我一定赢！$"

Route121_Text_CristinRegister:
	.string "太丢脸了！\n"
	.string "我不会忘记你……\l"
	.string "把导航交出来！$"

Route121_Text_CristinRematchIntro:
	.string "我有了新习惯。\n"
	.string "一天打倒十个训练家。\l"
	.string "猜怎么着？你是第十个！$"

Route121_Text_CristinRematchDefeat:
	.string "等等！太卑鄙了！\n"
	.string "我要求再来一场！$"

Route121_Text_CristinPostRematch:
	.string "怎么我也赢不了的对手……\n"
	.string "抽泣……\l"
	.string "真不敢相信……$"

Route121_Text_CaleIntro:
	.string "你没看到我手上\n"
	.string "拿满了东西吗？\p"
	.string "就算这样，你还非要\n"
	.string "和我对战？$"

Route121_Text_CaleDefeat:
	.string "我当然输了！\n"
	.string "我两只手都占着呢！$"

Route121_Text_CalePostBattle:
	.string "我在琉璃百货大楼\n"
	.string "买太多了。\p"
	.string "就在前面那条路。\n"
	.string "真想要个像你那样的背包。$"

Route121_Text_MylesIntro:
	.string "我最喜欢看别人的\n"
	.string "宝可梦了！$"

Route121_Text_MylesDefeat:
	.string "太棒了！$"

Route121_Text_MylesPostBattle:
	.string "你的宝可梦真棒！\n"
	.string "你是怎么培养的？$"

Route121_Text_PatIntro:
	.string "我想让大家都看看\n"
	.string "我培养的宝可梦！$"

Route121_Text_PatDefeat:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "太精彩了！$"

Route121_Text_PatPostBattle:
	.string "我对每只宝可梦都一样\n"
	.string "用心——从不偏心。$"

Route121_Text_MarcelIntro:
	.string "我的宝可梦从没输过！\n"
	.string "下次赢了我就带它们\l"
	.string "去参加华丽大赛。$"

Route121_Text_MarcelDefeat:
	.string "哦，这是怎么回事？$"

Route121_Text_MarcelPostBattle:
	.string "看来我得再多训练一下\n"
	.string "伙计们，才能参加华丽大赛。$"

Route123_Text_WendyIntro:
	.string "想知道自己有多强吗？\n"
	.string "我来做试金石！$"

Route123_Text_WendyDefeat:
	.string "你以优异的成绩通过了！$"

Route123_Text_WendyPostBattle:
	.string "连我都赢了……\n"
	.string "你的实力真了不起！$"

Route123_Text_BraxtonIntro:
	.string "你好像收集了不少\n"
	.string "道馆徽章。\p"
	.string "让我看看你到底\n"
	.string "配不配得上那些徽章！$"

Route123_Text_BraxtonDefeat:
	.string "哦，你确实配得上！$"

Route123_Text_BraxtonPostBattle:
	.string "那场比赛你没给徽章\n"
	.string "丢脸！$"

Route123_Text_VioletIntro:
	.string "据说快乐的时光\n"
	.string "总是充满美好的香气。$"

Route123_Text_VioletDefeat:
	.string "哦……\n"
	.string "我闻到了痛苦的苦味……$"

Route123_Text_VioletPostBattle:
	.string "树果名人的花园里\n"
	.string "满是令人振奋的香气。$"

Route123_Text_CameronIntro:
	.string "超能力者靠的是意志。\p"
	.string "我一直不允许自己输给\n"
	.string "任何人。所以我很强！$"

Route123_Text_CameronDefeat:
	.string "我好难过……$"

Route123_Text_CameronPostBattle:
	.string "超能力者靠的是意志。\n"
	.string "我以为我不会输给你……$"

Route123_Text_CameronRegister:
	.string "我感觉到了！\n"
	.string "我们还会再战的！\l"
	.string "不过我不确定会不会赢……\p"
	.string "让我看看你的导航。$"

Route123_Text_CameronRematchIntro:
	.string "我已经说服自己\n"
	.string "不会再输了。所以我很强！$"

Route123_Text_CameronRematchDefeat:
	.string "我好难过……$"

Route123_Text_CameronPostRematch:
	.string "我该去送神山修行……\n"
	.string "这样永远赢不了你……$"

Route123_Text_JackiIntro:
