	.string "让我给你的零花钱添一点吧。$"

Route123_Text_FrederickPostBattle:
	.string "给你的零花钱添一点？\n"
	.string "奖金还不够吗？$"

Route123_Text_AlbertoIntro:
	.string "我得告诉你，我对\n"
	.string "鸟宝可梦简直是痴迷！\p"
	.string "鸟很酷！\n"
	.string "它们是最棒的！$"

Route123_Text_AlbertoDefeat:
	.string "就算输了，鸟宝可梦也很酷！$"

Route123_Text_AlbertoPostBattle:
