Route123_Text_EdPostBattle:
	.string "嘿嘿，我在偷学你的点子！\n"
	.string "我觉得那会让我变强。$"

Route123_Text_JonasIntro:
	.string "我在这里埋伏，\n"
	.string "结果有训练家落进我的陷阱！$"

Route123_Text_JonasDefeat:
	.string "你都不输，\n"
	.string "我还怎么玩忍者游戏？$"

Route123_Text_JonasPostBattle:
	.string "下次我要埋伏\n"
	.string "看起来更弱的训练家。$"

Route123_Text_KayleyIntro:
	.string "我刚买了这把阳伞。\n"
	.string "我的可爱度应该提升三成！$"

Route123_Text_KayleyDefeat:
	.string "你比我强大约五倍！$"

Route123_Text_KayleyPostBattle:
	.string "善用饰品，\n"
	.string "才是时尚魅力的秘诀。$"

Route124_Text_SpencerIntro:
	.string "多美的景色啊，\n"
	.string "正好让我练火舞！$"

Route124_Text_SpencerDefeat:
	.string "火灭了！$"

Route124_Text_SpencerPostBattle:
	.string "这附近甚至开始\n"
	.string "长草了。$"

Route124_Text_RolandIntro:
	.string "嗯！你自己不游，\n"
	.string "骑在宝可梦上……\p"
	.string "真让我羡慕！$"

Route124_Text_RolandDefeat:
	.string "哦！\n"
	.string "我不行了……$"

Route124_Text_RolandPostBattle:
	.string "我冷起来了……\n"
	.string "在水里待太久了……\p"
	.string "真想像你一样骑宝可梦……$"

Route124_Text_JennyIntro:
	.string "我一直在等强者\n"
	.string "出现！$"

Route124_Text_JennyDefeat:
	.string "你太强了！$"

Route124_Text_JennyPostBattle:
	.string "训练时我注意到，有些宝可梦\n"
	.string "会主动攻击，有些只是看着。\p"
	.string "我想宝可梦也有\n"
	.string "自己的个性吧。$"

Route124_Text_JennyRegister:
	.string "虽然只是一时兴起，不过\n"
	.string "也许可以请你登记我一下。$"

Route124_Text_JennyRematchIntro:
	.string "就这样漂在海上，\n"
	.string "就会有训练家来挑战你！$"

Route124_Text_JennyRematchDefeat:
	.string "真奇怪……\n"
	.string "我又输了……$"

Route124_Text_JennyPostRematch:
	.string "这跟什么都无关，不过\n"
	.string "也许我该去机关屋看看。$"

Route124_Text_GraceIntro:
	.string "这炽热的阳光造出了\n"
	.string "一片小沙滩……怎么样？$"

Route124_Text_GraceDefeat:
	.string "你毁了我在沙滩上的训练！$"

Route124_Text_GracePostBattle:
	.string "我该带防晒霜的。$"

Route124_Text_ChadIntro:
	.string "呵呵呵……我潜入深水，\n"
	.string "是为了做深度卧底。\l"
	.string "探查深处正是我的专长！$"

Route124_Text_ChadDefeat:
	.string "咕噜、咕噜……\n"
	.string "我在下沉……$"

Route124_Text_ChadPostBattle:
	.string "我有可靠消息说，\n"
	.string "这附近有个潜水点。\p"
	.string "这让我又想去深处了……$"

Route124_Text_LilaIntro:
	.string "莉拉：唉……\p"
	.string "我来到了海边，可身边是谁？\n"
	.string "是我弟弟！\p"
	.string "来对战吧，省得我老想这些！$"

Route124_Text_LilaDefeat:
	.string "莉拉：ROY！输了都怪你！\n"
	.string "等会儿有你受的！$"

Route124_Text_LilaPostBattle:
	.string "莉拉：唉……\p"
	.string "要是身边是个帅哥就好了……$"

Route124_Text_LilaNotEnoughMons:
	.string "莉拉：你想和我们打？\n"
	.string "没有两只宝可梦可不行。$"

Route124_Text_RoyIntro:
	.string "罗伊：我姐姐对战很厉害！\p"
	.string "输了可别哭！$"

Route124_Text_RoyDefeat:
	.string "罗伊：糟了……\n"
	.string "姐姐要骂我了……$"

Route124_Text_RoyPostBattle:
	.string "罗伊：我姐姐生气时\n"
	.string "真的很可怕。\p"
	.string "所以她才没有男朋友。$"

Route124_Text_LilaRoyRegister:
	.string "罗伊：你还会再和我们打吗？\n"
	.string "不过下次让着我们点，好吗？$"

Route124_Text_RoyNotEnoughMons:
	.string "罗伊：你想和我们打？\n"
	.string "那就带两只宝可梦来。$"

Route124_Text_LilaRematchIntro:
	.string "莉拉：唉……\p"
	.string "我来到了海边，可身边是谁？\n"
	.string "是我弟弟！\p"
	.string "哦，好久不见，来对战吧！$"

Route124_Text_LilaRematchDefeat:
	.string "莉拉：ROY！\n"
	.string "又输了，都怪你！\p"
	.string "等会儿要特训！$"

Route124_Text_LilaPostRematch:
	.string "莉拉：唉……\p"
	.string "要是身边是个帅哥就好了……\n"
	.string "一定能配合赢过任何人……$"

Route124_Text_LilaRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "莉拉：你想和我们打？\n"
	.string "没有两只宝可梦可不行。$"

Route124_Text_RoyRematchIntro:
	.string "罗伊：要是输了，我可要挨骂。\n"
	.string "我要全力以赴！$"

Route124_Text_RoyRematchDefeat:
	.string "罗伊：糟了……\n"
	.string "姐姐又要骂我了。$"

Route124_Text_RoyPostRematch:
	.string "罗伊：我姐姐生气时\n"
	.string "真的很可怕。\p"
	.string "等会儿她肯定要逼着\n"
	.string "我拼命训练……$"

Route124_Text_RoyRematchNotEnoughMons:
	.string "罗伊：你想和我们打？\n"
	.string "那就带两只宝可梦来。$"

Route124_Text_DeclanIntro:
	.string "我在这种热天训练已经\n"
	.string "出了一身汗。随时能打！$"

Route124_Text_DeclanDefeat:
	.string "只好冷静一下了……$"

Route124_Text_DeclanPostBattle:
	.string "稍微休息一下没坏处。$"

Route124_Text_IsabellaIntro:
	.string "我才不是小孩子！$"

Route124_Text_IsabellaDefeat:
	.string "我只是眼睛里进了汗！\n"
	.string "我没哭！$"

Route124_Text_IsabellaPostBattle:
	.string "这附近能找到\n"
	.string "颜色漂亮的碎片。$"

Route125_Text_NolenIntro:
	.string "我听到你过来了，\n"
	.string "就一直等着你！$"

Route125_Text_NolenDefeat:
	.string "我投降！$"

Route125_Text_NolenPostBattle:
	.string "声音在水里比在空气中\n"
	.string "传播得更快。$"

Route125_Text_StanIntro:
	.string "喂，你好！\n"
	.string "看看我可爱的宝可梦！$"

Route125_Text_StanDefeat:
	.string "我手脚都乱了……$"

Route125_Text_StanPostBattle:
	.string "我被墨海马的魅力迷住，\n"
	.string "于是也开始游泳了。$"

Route125_Text_TanyaIntro:
	.string "我游累了。\n"
	.string "要和我打一场吗？$"

Route125_Text_TanyaDefeat:
	.string "你太过分了！$"

Route125_Text_TanyaPostBattle:
	.string "呼……\n"
	.string "绿岭市往哪边走？$"

Route125_Text_SharonIntro:
	.string "要不要和我培养的\n"
	.string "水属性宝可梦对战？$"

Route125_Text_SharonDefeat:
	.string "输了啊……$"

Route125_Text_SharonPostBattle:
	.string "你的实力……真是名不虚传。\n"
	.string "我服了！$"

Route125_Text_ErnestIntro:
	.string "哟！我是壮实的水手！\n"
	.string "我闯过世界的大海！$"

Route125_Text_ErnestDefeat:
	.string "嗷呜！\n"
	.string "我赢不了！$"

Route125_Text_ErnestPostBattle:
	.string "浅滩洞穴里的潮水\n"
	.string "会涨会退。\p"
	.string "顺便说，从满潮到干潮\n"
	.string "约六小时。你知道吗？$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRegister:
	.string "把我登记进你的导航，\n"
	.string "我就告诉你件好事。$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRematchIntro:
	.string "是时候向你报仇了！\n"
	.string "来吧，对战！$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRematchDefeat:
	.string "赢不了！\n"
	.string "我完全赢不了！$"

Route125_Text_ErnestRematchPostBattle:
	.string "浅滩洞穴……\p"
	.string "随着潮水涨落，有些地方\n"
	.string "能去，有些地方去不了。\p"
	.string "顺便说，从满潮到干潮\n"
	.string "约六小时。别忘了！$"

Route125_Text_KimIntro:
	.string "金：听说浅滩洞穴里\n"
	.string "住着一个有趣的老爷爷。\l"
	.string "你也要去看他吗？$"

Route125_Text_KimDefeat:
	.string "金：我还以为我们会赢。$"

Route125_Text_KimPostBattle:
	.string "金：浅滩洞穴里住着\n"
	.string "一个有趣的老爷爷吧？\p"
	.string "我们去看他吧，艾莉丝！$"

Route125_Text_KimNotEnoughMons:
	.string "金：不行不行！没有两只\n"
	.string "宝可梦可不行！$"

Route125_Text_IrisIntro:
	.string "艾莉丝：金，你能告诉我\n"
	.string "我们在这里找什么吗？$"

Route125_Text_IrisDefeat:
	.string "艾莉丝：哦，我们好像差一点。$"

Route125_Text_IrisPostBattle:
	.string "艾莉丝：金，我们真的要\n"
	.string "进浅滩洞穴吗？\l"
	.string "会全身湿透的。$"

Route125_Text_IrisNotEnoughMons:
	.string "艾莉丝：哦，我们绝对不会\n"
	.string "做二对一这种事。$"

Route125_Text_PresleyIntro:
	.string "像我这样的养鸟人\n"
	.string "为什么来到海边？$"

Route125_Text_PresleyDefeat:
	.string "好吧。\n"
	.string "我告诉你我为什么在这里。$"

Route125_Text_PresleyPostBattle:
	.string "我把一封信装进瓶子\n"
	.string "放进了大海。\p"
	.string "我相信会有女泳装训练家\n"
	.string "捡到它！$"

Route125_Text_AuronIntro:
	.string "喂！是你往海里\n"
	.string "扔垃圾吗？$"

Route125_Text_AuronDefeat:
	.string "哦，你不是往海里\n"
	.string "扔垃圾啊。$"

Route125_Text_AuronPostBattle:
	.string "我刚才在波浪里发现\n"
	.string "一个难看的瓶子。\p"
	.string "有人污染大海，\n"
	.string "真让我生气！$"

Route126_Text_BarryIntro:
	.string "游泳是全身运动！\n"
	.string "会让你变结实！$"

Route126_Text_BarryDefeat:
	.string "我认输！\n"
	.string "你赢了！$"

Route126_Text_BarryPostBattle:
	.string "多亏了每天游泳……\n"
	.string "看！尽情欣赏这身材吧！$"

Route126_Text_DeanIntro:
	.string "这座高耸的白色岩石山\n"
	.string "就是琉璃市。$"

Route126_Text_DeanDefeat:
	.string "我被干掉了？$"

Route126_Text_DeanPostBattle:
	.string "我找不到琉璃市的\n"
	.string "入口。到底在哪呢？$"

Route126_Text_NikkiIntro:
	.string "呵呵呵呵！\n"
	.string "我是美人鱼！$"

Route126_Text_NikkiDefeat:
	.string "我的幻想像气泡一样破了！\n"
	.string "咕噜、咕噜……$"

Route126_Text_NikkiPostBattle:
	.string "你把我打败了……我真想\n"
	.string "在绝望的浪里消失……$"

Route126_Text_BrendaIntro:
	.string "你好，小朋友！\n"
	.string "要和我打一场吗？$"

Route126_Text_BrendaDefeat:
	.string "哦，不——！$"

Route126_Text_BrendaPostBattle:
	.string "我最爱像这样和宝可梦\n"
	.string "在海里嬉戏！$"

Route126_Text_PabloIntro:
	.string "看看这健美的身体！\n"
	.string "我比空手道王还要有型！$"

Route126_Text_PabloDefeat:
	.string "哎呀！太强了！\n"
	.string "不错！真的很不错！$"

Route126_Text_PabloPostBattle:
	.string "输给你刺激了我的感官！\n"
	.string "我要更努力锻炼！$"

Route126_Text_PabloRegister:
	.string "对，你真的很不错！\n"
	.string "我想更了解你！$"

Route126_Text_PabloRematchIntro:
	.string "看看这美丽的身体！\n"
	.string "我比泳装女还要匀称！$"

Route126_Text_PabloRematchDefeat:
	.string "哎呀！真的太强了！\n"
	.string "不错！真的很不错！$"

Route126_Text_PabloPostRematch:
	.string "我要更刻苦地训练！\n"
	.string "你真是很好的激励！\l"
	.string "你一定要再来！$"

Route126_Text_LeonardoIntro:
	.string "去年我还不会游泳，\n"
	.string "但现在我是像样的泳装男了。\p"
	.string "我觉得现在什么都能做到。$"

Route126_Text_LeonardoDefeat:
	.string "唉，贪心一点用也没有。$"

Route126_Text_LeonardoPostBattle:
	.string "只要练习，什么都会\n"
	.string "变得更好。\p"
	.string "你还年轻——别怕\n"
	.string "尝试各种事情！$"

Route126_Text_IsobelIntro:
	.string "海水呛进鼻子里，\n"
	.string "是不是很难受？$"

Route126_Text_IsobelDefeat:
	.string "呃！你、你这个……\n"
	.string "咕噜！$"

Route126_Text_IsobelPostBattle:
	.string "哦，我呛到水了！\n"
	.string "又苦又咸！！$"

Route126_Text_SiennaIntro:
	.string "我可是把全部心意\n"
	.string "都投进去了！$"

Route126_Text_SiennaDefeat:
	.string "你的心意更多！$"

Route126_Text_SiennaPostBattle:
	.string "我现在得冷静一下……\n"
	.string "我想去潜水。$"

Route127_Text_CamdenIntro:
	.string "我从你脸上看出来了。\n"
	.string "你想挑战我。$"

Route127_Text_CamdenDefeat:
	.string "哇哇哇哇哇……$"

Route127_Text_CamdenPostBattle:
	.string "一场精彩的比赛让我\n"
	.string "神清气爽、心平气和。$"

Route127_Text_DonnyIntro:
	.string "你有没有那种\n"
	.string "输给他就很不甘心的对手？$"

Route127_Text_DonnyDefeat:
	.string "啊啊！\n"
	.string "我讨厌输！$"

Route127_Text_DonnyPostBattle:
	.string "有了对手，是不是就会\n"
	.string "觉得必须不断变强？$"

Route127_Text_JonahIntro:
	.string "通过钓鱼，我达到了\n"
	.string "心如止水的境界……\p"
	.string "请让我为你展示……$"

Route127_Text_JonahDefeat:
	.string "虽然输了，\n"
	.string "我的心依然平静……$"

Route127_Text_JonahPostBattle:
	.string "钓不到也没关系。\n"
	.string "鱼线还在水中……$"

Route127_Text_HenryIntro:
	.string "哎呀！别告诉我我\n"
	.string "钓到了冲浪的宝可梦？$"

Route127_Text_HenryDefeat:
	.string "我跟不上！$"

Route127_Text_HenryPostBattle:
	.string "要是钓到你那只强宝可梦，\n"
	.string "可就有得忙了！$"

Route127_Text_RogerIntro:
	.string "嘿，好啊！这是宝可梦迷\n"
	.string "和钓鱼迷之间的比赛！$"

Route127_Text_RogerDefeat:
	.string "不！我的线全缠住了！\n"
	.string "派对结束了！$"

Route127_Text_RogerPostBattle:
	.string "我的鱼线在跳舞！\n"
	.string "缠线探戈！哈哈，哎哟！$"

Route127_Text_AidanIntro:
	.string "鸟宝可梦视力极佳。\n"
	.string "能从高处发现猎物。$"

Route127_Text_AidanDefeat:
	.string "呼……我认输。$"

Route127_Text_AidanPostBattle:
	.string "这附近的海里有很多\n"
	.string "潜水点。\p"
	.string "从天上很容易发现，\n"
	.string "因为那里的颜色更深。$"

Route127_Text_KojiIntro:
	.string "光着脚跑吧。\n"
	.string "那样能锻炼脚底！$"

Route127_Text_KojiDefeat:
	.string "哎哟！\n"
	.string "脚趾甲里进了小石子！$"

Route127_Text_KojiPostBattle:
	.string "光脚很舒服。\n"
	.string "不过你的跑鞋也很酷。$"

Route127_Text_KojiRegister:
	.string "这是我对待赢我的人的方式！\n"
	.string "希望还能再来一次。$"

Route127_Text_KojiRematchIntro:
	.string "我每天还是光脚跑。\n"
	.string "我的脚底很结实！$"

Route127_Text_KojiRematchDefeat:
	.string "哎哟！\n"
	.string "石子扎进脚心了！$"

Route127_Text_KojiPostRematch:
	.string "要不要也光脚跑一会儿？\n"
	.string "好让我试试你的跑鞋？$"

Route127_Text_AthenaIntro:
	.string "我们该来一场\n"
	.string "从容不迫的比赛。$"

Route127_Text_AthenaDefeat:
	.string "你连让我制定策略的\n"
	.string "机会都没给。$"

Route127_Text_AthenaPostBattle:
	.string "被蓝色的大海和天空环绕，\n"
	.string "时间好像都变慢了。$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahIntro:
	.string "距离彩幽市\n"
	.string "还很远……$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahDefeat:
	.string "我的首场胜利似乎\n"
	.string "也很遥远……$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahPostBattle:
	.string "我的人生一直在输，\n"
	.string "但我绝不放弃！$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahRegister:
	.string "我知道我现在不行，\n"
	.string "但我想我终会赢。\p"
	.string "请把我登记进你的导航。$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahRematchIntro:
	.string "我状态还是很好。我会\n"
	.string "一直游向彩幽市。$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahRematchDefeat:
	.string "我还没尝过\n"
	.string "首场胜利的滋味……$"

Route128_Text_IsaiahPostRematch:
	.string "我终会到达彩幽市，\n"
	.string "在那里终会赢……$"

Route128_Text_KatelynIntro:
	.string "铁人三项要游泳、骑车，\n"
	.string "然后跑马拉松。\p"
	.string "这是由三个项目组成的\n"
	.string "残酷比赛。$"

Route128_Text_KatelynDefeat:
	.string "宝可梦对战也很残酷……$"

Route128_Text_KatelynPostBattle:
	.string "接下来还要骑车，可是……\n"
	.string "我快撑不住了……$"

Route128_Text_KatelynRegister:
	.string "好吧，那就尽量利用吧。\n"
	.string "我想找时间再打一场。$"

Route128_Text_KatelynRematchIntro:
	.string "铁人三项很漫长。不过我想\n"
	.string "成为宝可梦冠军的路\l"
	.string "也一样漫长而艰苦。$"

Route128_Text_KatelynRematchDefeat:
	.string "宝可梦对战真是\n"
	.string "严酷无情……$"

Route128_Text_KatelynPostRematch:
	.string "你该认真考虑一下\n"
	.string "冠军之路的挑战。$"

Route128_Text_AlexaIntro:
	.string "我们一直拼命努力，\n"
	.string "就为了挑战宝可梦联盟……\p"
	.string "现在可不能输！$"

Route128_Text_AlexaDefeat:
	.string "哦！\n"
	.string "怎么会这样？！$"

Route128_Text_AlexaPostBattle:
	.string "我一路拼到这里，\n"
	.string "不会因一次挫折就放弃。$"

Route128_Text_RubenIntro:
	.string "没有比我更强的训练家！$"

Route128_Text_RubenDefeat:
	.string "这不可能！$"

Route128_Text_RubenPostBattle:
	.string "大概没有比你更强的\n"
	.string "训练家！$"

Route128_Text_WayneIntro:
	.string "我想去彩幽市，\n"
	.string "就抓了只会攀瀑的宝可梦\l"
	.string "好登上瀑布。$"

Route128_Text_WayneDefeat:
	.string "我垂头丧气了！$"

Route128_Text_WaynePostBattle:
	.string "唉，真倒霉！\p"
	.string "我的宝可梦会攀瀑，\n"
	.string "但我没有琉璃道馆的徽章！$"

Route128_Text_HarrisonIntro:
	.string "你看起来很强啊。\n"
	.string "不知道我能不能赢？$"

Route128_Text_HarrisonDefeat:
	.string "哎哟！\n"
	.string "看来是赢不了。$"

Route128_Text_HarrisonPostBattle:
	.string "彩幽市附近有很多\n"
	.string "很强的训练家。\p"
	.string "你觉得我是不是\n"
	.string "不太够格？$"

Route128_Text_CarleeIntro:
	.string "这一带的阳光\n"
	.string "好像更强烈。$"

Route128_Text_CarleeDefeat:
	.string "阳光太刺眼，\n"
	.string "我看不太清。$"

Route128_Text_CarleePostBattle:
	.string "我该早点回去。\n"
	.string "得重新涂防晒霜。$"

Route129_Text_ChaseIntro:
	.string "这是我的第一次铁人三项。\n"
	.string "我紧张得不得了！$"

Route129_Text_ChaseDefeat:
	.string "嗷呜！\n"
	.string "我没能赢！$"

Route129_Text_ChasePostBattle:
	.string "要是全身紧绷，\n"
	.string "就没法发挥全力。$"

Route129_Text_AllisonIntro:
	.string "我正在铁人三项中，\n"
	.string "不过，好吧，来打一场？$"

Route129_Text_AllisonDefeat:
	.string "我还以为自己一定会赢！$"

Route129_Text_AllisonPostBattle:
	.string "你知道铁人三项\n"
	.string "最棒的地方是什么吗？\p"
	.string "就是在自然面前挑战\n"
	.string "自己力量和耐力的极限！$"

Route129_Text_ReedIntro:
	.string "嘿，嘿！\n"
	.string "我们快点开始吧！$"

Route129_Text_ReedDefeat:
	.string "败了，我败了。\n"
	.string "就这样，完蛋！$"

Route129_Text_ReedPostBattle:
	.string "输家什么都没剩下。\n"
	.string "我该回家去了。$"

Route129_Text_TishaIntro:
	.string "急什么？\n"
	.string "慢慢来，轻轻松松。$"

Route129_Text_TishaDefeat:
	.string "哎呀。\n"
	.string "我还想再放松一会儿……$"

Route129_Text_TishaPostBattle:
	.string "你讨厌匆忙时犯错吧？\p"
	.string "所以我才尽量慢慢来。$"

Route129_Text_ClarenceIntro:
	.string "冲浪并不像看起来\n"
	.string "那么简单，对吧？$"

Route129_Text_ClarenceDefeat:
	.string "赢确实不容易。$"

Route129_Text_ClarencePostBattle:
	.string "你的目标是宝可梦联盟？\n"
	.string "继续加油！$"

Route130_Text_RodneyIntro:
	.string "真意外！没想到在海上\n"
	.string "会遇到训练家。\p"
	.string "我觉得我们应该对战！$"

Route130_Text_RodneyDefeat:
	.string "这孩子真够强的……$"

Route130_Text_RodneyPostBattle:
	.string "你的眼睛里有那种经历过\n"
	.string "严酷挑战并获胜的光。\l"
	.string "很适合你！$"

Route130_Text_KatieIntro:
	.string "在深蓝的大海里，\n"
	.string "我破碎的蓝色心灵\l"
	.string "在波浪间寻得安慰。$"

Route130_Text_KatieDefeat:
	.string "就像辽阔的蓝色大海，\n"
	.string "宝可梦的世界\l"
	.string "深不见底。$"

Route130_Text_KatiePostBattle:
	.string "世上的孩子们都梦想\n"
	.string "有一天成为\l"
	.string "宝可梦冠军。$"

Route130_Text_SantiagoIntro:
	.string "像这样漂在开阔的海上……\n"
	.string "真平静。$"

Route130_Text_SantiagoDefeat:
	.string "我该少平静一点！$"

Route130_Text_SantiagoPostBattle:
	.string "又能游泳又能对战……\n"
	.string "我真是个快乐的家伙……$"

Route131_Text_RichardIntro:
	.string "海里满是宝可梦。\n"
	.string "跟你说，游泳可不轻松。$"

Route131_Text_RichardDefeat:
	.string "训练家培养的宝可梦\n"
	.string "真的很强……$"

Route131_Text_RichardPostBattle:
	.string "呼……呼……\n"
	.string "我累垮了……\p"
	.string "出发容易，回程可难。\p"
	.string "我还有力气游回去吗？$"

Route131_Text_HermanIntro:
	.string "海……海……海……\n"
	.string "放眼望去全是海！\l"
	.string "我看腻这片海了！$"

Route131_Text_HermanDefeat:
	.string "噗！$"

Route131_Text_HermanPostBattle:
	.string "我对海看腻了，\n"
	.string "可我必须游。\p"
	.string "我天生就是游泳的！\n"
	.string "就是这样。$"

Route131_Text_SusieIntro:
	.string "嗨，亲爱的，等等！\n"
	.string "我们该打一场，你和我！$"

Route131_Text_SusieDefeat:
	.string "别看你这副样子，\n"
	.string "还挺能打的！$"

Route131_Text_SusiePostBattle:
	.string "你看到那边那个抱怨\n"
	.string "海很无聊的家伙了吗？\p"
	.string "那全是嘴上说说。\n"
	.string "他其实爱死这片海了！$"

Route131_Text_KaraIntro:
	.string "男人为什么这么爱泳装？\p"
	.string "他们都在盯着我看！$"

Route131_Text_KaraDefeat:
	.string "我招架不住了！$"

Route131_Text_KaraPostBattle:
	.string "男人们看我的眼光，\n"
	.string "也许不是因为泳装。\l"
	.string "一定是因为我的美貌！$"

Route131_Text_ReliIntro:
	.string "雷利：我们姐弟一起\n"
	.string "来对付你！$"

Route131_Text_ReliDefeat:
	.string "雷利：就算我们一起\n"
	.string "也没能赢……$"

Route131_Text_ReliPostBattle:
	.string "雷利：琉璃镇的人从出生起\n"
	.string "就和大海与宝可梦在一起。$"

Route131_Text_ReliNotEnoughMons:
	.string "雷利：你没有两只宝可梦？\n"
	.string "那可没法享受对战了。$"

Route131_Text_IanIntro:
	.string "IAN：我和姐姐一起\n"
	.string "全力以赴！$"

Route131_Text_IanDefeat:
	.string "IAN：我和姐姐一起\n"
	.string "努力了，可还是赢不了……$"

Route131_Text_IanPostBattle:
	.string "IAN：你知道琉璃镇是\n"
	.string "漂浮的小镇吗？\p"
	.string "所以凡是有海的地方，\n"
	.string "都是琉璃镇的一部分！$"

Route131_Text_IanNotEnoughMons:
	.string "IAN：你要有两只宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我们就和你打！$"

Route131_Text_TaliaIntro:
	.string "你要是能打赢我，\n"
	.string "我就告诉你个好消息！$"

Route131_Text_TaliaDefeat:
	.string "哦？\n"
	.string "我输了？$"

Route131_Text_TaliaPostBattle:
	.string "这附近有个奇怪的地方。\n"
	.string "那里有座巨大的塔。\l"
	.string "你去看看吧？$"

Route131_Text_KevinIntro:
	.string "琉璃镇的人\n"
	.string "都很平和。\p"
	.string "他们从不发火。\n"
	.string "我也不例外。$"

Route131_Text_KevinDefeat:
	.string "哎呀！$"

Route131_Text_KevinPostBattle:
	.string "啧！……哦，等等。\n"
	.string "我没生气。真的！\p"
	.string "不过，你可真强！\n"
	.string "哈哈哈！$"

Route132_Text_GilbertIntro:
	.string "我小时候老是感冒，\n"
	.string "开始游泳之后\l"
	.string "就变得非常结实了。$"

Route132_Text_GilbertDefeat:
	.string "我渴望更强的力量……$"

Route132_Text_GilbertPostBattle:
	.string "训练家要走遍原野和\n"
	.string "山岭，所以也必须结实。$"

Route132_Text_DanaIntro:
	.string "我尽量不在水流\n"
	.string "太急的地方游泳。$"

Route132_Text_DanaDefeat:
	.string "哦，求你了，不要！$"

Route132_Text_DanaPostBattle:
	.string "要是被冲走，\n"
	.string "我就完全不知道\l"
	.string "自己在哪了……$"

Route132_Text_RonaldIntro:
	.string "输赢如何，不试试\n"
	.string "谁也不知道！$"

Route132_Text_RonaldDefeat:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "我沉入了败北之中！$"

Route132_Text_RonaldPostBattle:
	.string "明知会赢的对战我不打。\n"
	.string "我喜欢在胜负的边缘\l"
	.string "进行对战！$"

Route132_Text_KiyoIntro:
	.string "我一天二十四小时\n"
	.string "都在琢磨宝可梦。\l"
	.string "你怎么可能赢我？$"

Route132_Text_KiyoDefeat:
	.string "我输了。\n"
	.string "我认输。$"

Route132_Text_KiyoPostBattle:
	.string "呃……\n"
	.string "你也是宝可梦狂吧？\p"
	.string "你肯定也是一天二十四小时\n"
	.string "都在琢磨宝可梦，对吧？$"

Route132_Text_MakaylaIntro:
	.string "我总是和丈夫在一起，\n"
	.string "不过没有他我也能赢。$"

Route132_Text_MakaylaDefeat:
	.string "哦，看来我还是不够强。$"

Route132_Text_MakaylaPostBattle:
	.string "那边那个年轻人，\n"
	.string "长得就像我丈夫年轻时。\p"
	.string "真让我脸红！$"

Route132_Text_JonathanIntro:
	.string "有人一直在盯着我。\n"
	.string "是你吗？$"

Route132_Text_JonathanDefeat:
	.string "哇！\n"
	.string "确实很强！$"

Route132_Text_JonathanPostBattle:
	.string "我总觉得有人在\n"
	.string "看着我。\p"
	.string "我无法集中精神！$"

Route132_Text_PaxtonIntro:
	.string "我妻子去哪了？\n"
	.string "我总是和她在一起。\l"
	.string "不知道我一个人能不能赢。$"

Route132_Text_PaxtonDefeat:
	.string "啊，看来我一个人\n"
	.string "果然赢不了。$"

Route132_Text_PaxtonPostBattle:
	.string "我妻子一定在找我。\n"
	.string "我得赶紧去找她。$"

Route132_Text_DarcyIntro:
	.string "我本来喜欢一个人\n"
	.string "在这里训练。\l"
	.string "来了这么多人真讨厌！$"

Route132_Text_DarcyDefeat:
	.string "好！我不再抱怨\n"
	.string "别人在这里了。$"

Route132_Text_DarcyPostBattle:
	.string "也许我可以和那个老爷爷\n"
	.string "组队去挑战别的队伍。$"

Route133_Text_FranklinIntro:
	.string "你也是被水流冲到\n"
	.string "这里的吗？这一定是命运。\l"
	.string "来对战吧！$"

Route133_Text_FranklinDefeat:
	.string "强！\n"
	.string "太强了！$"

Route133_Text_FranklinPostBattle:
	.string "居然会有你这么强的\n"
	.string "训练家漂到这里……\l"
	.string "我真是倒霉……$"

Route133_Text_DebraIntro:
	.string "我这一生充满悲苦……\n"
	.string "我被抛弃，最后\l"
	.string "漂到了这里……$"

Route133_Text_DebraDefeat:
	.string "又输了……$"

Route133_Text_DebraPostBattle:
	.string "漂泊的人生……\n"
	.string "我不要再这样了！$"

Route133_Text_LindaIntro:
	.string "欢迎！\n"
	.string "我一直在等你！$"

Route133_Text_LindaDefeat:
	.string "不！求你了！$"

Route133_Text_LindaPostBattle:
	.string "这么小的孩子还这么强……\n"
	.string "真让人不甘心！$"

Route133_Text_WarrenIntro:
	.string "我想像大家一样赢，\n"
	.string "但我不会那样培养宝可梦。$"

Route133_Text_WarrenDefeat:
	.string "可恶！\n"
	.string "我的做法还是太松散了！$"

Route133_Text_WarrenPostBattle:
	.string "按自己的想法做，\n"
	.string "比随大流有趣多了。\l"
	.string "这不是明摆着的吗！$"

Route133_Text_BeckIntro:
	.string "我带着鸟宝可梦\n"
	.string "大老远来到这里。$"

Route133_Text_BeckDefeat:
	.string "你……\n"
	.string "你酷得惊人！$"

Route133_Text_BeckPostBattle:
	.string "我想回茵郁市，\n"
	.string "但我也渐渐喜欢上这里了。$"

Route133_Text_MollieIntro:
	.string "我对战过的次数\n"
	.string "大概有几千次。我数不清了。$"

Route133_Text_MollieDefeat:
	.string "我可能输过几千次，\n"
	.string "但输还是让人难受。$"

Route133_Text_MolliePostBattle:
	.string "继续努力吧，年轻人。\n"
	.string "这样你才能像我们夫妻一样。$"

Route133_Text_ConorIntro:
	.string "年轻人太爱随波逐流，\n"
	.string "没有方向。$"

Route133_Text_ConorDefeat:
	.string "你有明确的目标。$"

Route133_Text_ConorPostBattle:
	.string "别被别人带偏。\n"
	.string "别随着年龄失去方向。$"

Route134_Text_JackIntro:
	.string "就算是会游泳的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "也会被急流冲走。$"

Route134_Text_JackDefeat:
	.string "哎——呀！$"

Route134_Text_JackPostBattle:
	.string "我觉得宝可梦很喜欢\n"
	.string "这一带的急流。$"

Route134_Text_LaurelIntro:
	.string "我的爱心鱼在找\n"
	.string "有趣的比赛。要一起来吗？$"

Route134_Text_LaurelDefeat:
	.string "哎呀！$"

Route134_Text_LaurelPostBattle:
	.string "有个收藏家\n"
	.string "在收集爱心鱼的鳞片。$"

Route134_Text_AlexIntro:
	.string "好嘞！休息够了，伙计们！\n"
	.string "该比赛了！$"

Route134_Text_AlexDefeat:
	.string "又累垮了……$"

Route134_Text_AlexPostBattle:
	.string "我的鸟宝可梦长途飞行后\n"
	.string "很快就会累……$"

Route134_Text_HitoshiIntro:
	.string "你是宝可梦训练家。\n"
	.string "不用多说。现在对战。$"

Route134_Text_HitoshiDefeat:
	.string "………………\n"
	.string "………………$"

Route134_Text_HitoshiPostBattle:
	.string "明明是我挑战你，\n"
	.string "却输了。我深感羞愧……$"

Route134_Text_AaronIntro:
	.string "这一带的狂暴潮水\n"
	.string "能让我们变得更强。$"

Route134_Text_AaronDefeat:
	.string "我心服口服地认输。$"

Route134_Text_AaronPostBattle:
	.string "我们会再去流星瀑布\n"
	.string "继续训练。\p"
	.string "如果你愿意，也去吧。\n"
	.string "那一定会让你变强！$"

Route134_Text_KelvinIntro:
	.string "我、我们的船！\n"
	.string "被潮水冲走了！$"

Route134_Text_KelvinDefeat:
	.string "哇哇哇哇！\n"
	.string "求你了，停下！求你了！$"

Route134_Text_KelvinPostBattle:
	.string "不能冲浪的话，\n"
	.string "我们怎么回家？\p"
	.string "其实我知道倒下的宝可梦\n"
	.string "也能冲浪，但感觉不对。$"

Route134_Text_MarleyIntro:
	.string "你的宝可梦能躲开我们\n"
	.string "快如闪电的攻击吗？$"

Route134_Text_MarleyDefeat:
	.string "我从不知道还有这种技巧！\n"
	.string "你彻底打败了我们。$"

Route134_Text_MarleyPostBattle:
	.string "我对速度的热情没有消失。\n"
	.string "我会更努力。$"

Route134_Text_ReynaIntro:
	.string "我的宝可梦可不会\n"
	.string "轻易被打倒！$"

Route134_Text_ReynaDefeat:
	.string "你在开玩笑吧！\n"
	.string "解释一下我怎么会输！$"

Route134_Text_ReynaPostBattle:
	.string "哈哈！\n"
	.string "你确实赢了！\p"
	.string "我会挑战遇到的训练家，\n"
	.string "一步步爬回来！$"

Route134_Text_HudsonIntro:
	.string "喂，你在这附近看到\n"
	.string "别的水手了吗？$"

Route134_Text_HudsonDefeat:
	.string "哎呀，真了不起！$"

Route134_Text_HudsonPostBattle:
	.string "我们的船漂到海上去了。\p"
	.string "我的伙伴胆子小，\n"
	.string "我有点担心他。$"

VSSeeker_Text_BatteryNotChargedNeedXSteps::
	.string "电量不足。\p"
	.string "充满电所需的步数：\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"

VSSeeker_Text_NoTrainersWithinRange::
	.string "附近没有可以对战的\n"
	.string "训练家……\p"
	.string "对战搜寻器已关闭。{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"

VSSeeker_Text_TrainersNotReady::
	.string "其他训练家似乎还\n"
	.string "没准备好对战。\p"
	.string "我们晚点再来吧。{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"
